(2078, 'Marilyn Florez', 'florez.marilyn@googlemail.com', '41305964', 'From Someday to Success', 'canada', 'Do you have a project you’ve been dreaming of completing for years? A book you want to write or publish? A business you’re ready to start or grow? Imagine having your own dedicated team to help you get it across the finish line.\r\nAt WCD Marketing, we offer Accountability Coaching designed to turn your ideas into achievements. From “someday” to “success.”  We know how easy it is for goals to stall when life gets busy, and that’s why we’re here to keep you focused, motivated, and moving forward.\r\nWhether it’s a creative project, a business venture, or a personal milestone, our proven strategies and expert guidance will help you overcome obstacles, stay on track, and achieve the success you’ve envisioned. We don’t just set goals; we make them happen—together.\r\nDon’t let another year pass with your dreams on hold. Contact us today and take the first step toward making your vision a reality.  Contact me at wilene@wcdenterprises.com or WCD Marketing and let’s start your journey to success.\r\nYour breakthrough is waiting—let’s make it happen!\r\n\r\n----------------\r\nHere is the link to the form\r\nhttps://wcdmarketing.com/contact/', '2024-12-25 00:44:13', '2024-12-25 00:44:13'),
