(2543, 'Dr Simra Siddiqui', 'dr.simrasiddiqui@imgtalkwithsimra.com', '+61 477 256 551', 'Proposal for Sponsorship: \"Gateway to Australia\" Career Guidance Event for Doctors and Pharmacists', 'australia', 'Dear lalaniassociates Team,\r\n\r\nWe are excited to introduce \"Emergency Focus,\" a leading career guidance platform dedicated to supporting doctors and pharmacists in their journey to migrate to Australia. As a freelancer with a passion for empowering medical professionals, I am organizing a comprehensive event in Pakistan to provide a step-by-step guide on how to successfully relocate to Australia.\r\n\r\nEvent Overview:\r\n\r\nThe \"Gateway to Australia\" event aims to bring together aspiring medical professionals and provide them with the necessary knowledge, skills, and resources to navigate the complex process of migrating to Australia. The event will cover key topics such as:\r\n\r\n1. Visa processing and application procedures\r\n2. Career opportunities and job market trends in Australia\r\n3. Accreditation and registration requirements for doctors and pharmacists\r\n4. Cultural adaptation and settlement strategies\r\n\r\nWhy Sponsor Our Event?\r\n\r\nBy sponsoring our event, your organization will have the opportunity to connect with a targeted audience of highly skilled medical professionals, showcasing your products or services and establishing your brand as a thought leader in the industry. Our event will provide a unique platform for you to:\r\n\r\n1. Increase brand visibility and awareness\r\n2. Network with potential clients and partners\r\n3. Showcase your expertise and thought leadership\r\n4. Contribute to the development of the medical community in Pakistan\r\n\r\nEvent Details:\r\n\r\nDate: \r\n[1. January 19, 2025\r\n2. January 26, 2025\r\n3. February 2, 2025\r\n4. February 9, 2025]\r\n\r\nLocation: [Any Hotel located at Club Road- Karachi ], Pakistan\r\nExpected Attendance: 200-250 medical professionals\r\nCost: PKR 1.5 million (approximately USD 9,500)\r\n\r\nAbout Us:\r\n\r\nEmergency Focus is a reputable career guidance platform with a proven track record of supporting medical professionals in their migration journey to Australia. Our website www.emergencyfocus.net and Trustpilot reviews (https://www.trustpilot.com/review/emergencyfocus.net) demonstrate our commitment to delivering high-quality services and expertise.\r\n\r\nConclusion:\r\n\r\nWe believe that our \"Gateway to Australia\" event will provide a unique opportunity for your organization to connect with a targeted audience of medical professionals and showcase your products or services. We look forward to discussing this proposal in further detail and exploring how we can work together to make this event a success.\r\n\r\nPlease do not hesitate to contact me at [Your Email Address] or [Your Phone Number] to discuss this proposal and answer any questions you may have.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering our proposal.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n\r\nDr.Simra Siddiqui\r\n+61 477 256 551\r\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/simra-siddiqui-9453b4168?originalSubdomain=au\r\n\r\nAJeel Ahmed\r\n+923212690108\r\n\r\nMazz Alee.\r\n+92 331 2869204', '2025-01-15 06:47:23', '2025-01-15 06:47:23'),
