icians</td>\r\n<td class=\"column-2\">32104</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"row-7\">\r\n<td class=\"column-1\"><strong>&bull; </strong>Other technical occupations in therapy and assessment</td>\r\n<td class=\"column-2\">32109</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"row-8\">\r\n<td class=\"column-1\"><strong>&bull; </strong>Denturists</td>\r\n<td class=\"column-2\">32110</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"row-9\">\r\n<td class=\"column-1\"><strong>&bull; </strong>Dental hygienists and dental therapists</td>\r\n<td class=\"column-2\">32111</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"row-10\">\r\n<td class=\"column-1\"><strong>&bull; </strong>Dental technologists and technicians</td>\r\n<td class=\"column-2\">32112</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"row-11\">\r\n<td class=\"column-1\"><strong>&bull; </strong>Medical laboratory technologists</td>\r\n<td class=\"column-2\">32120</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"row-12\">\r\n<td class=\"column-1\"><strong>&bull; </strong>Medical radiation technologists</td>\r\n<td class=\"column-2\">32121</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"row-13\">\r\n<td class=\"column-1\"><strong>&bull; </strong>Medical sonographers</td>\r\n<td class=\"column-2\">32122</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"row-14\">\r\n<td class=\"column-1\"><strong>&bull; </strong>Cardiology technologists and electrophysiological diagnostic technologists</td>\r\n<td class=\"column-2\">32123</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"row-15\">\r\n<td class=\"column-1\"><strong>&bull; </strong>Pharmacy technicians</td>\r\n<td class=\"column-2\">32124</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"row-16\">\r\n<td class=\"column-1\"><strong>&bull; </strong>Other medical technologists and technicians</td>\r\n<td class=\"column-2\">32129</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"row-17\">\r\n<td class=\"column-1\"><strong>&bull; </strong>Traditional Chinese medicine practitioners and acupuncturists</td>\r\n<td class=\"column-2\">32200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"row-18\">\r\n<td class=\"column-1\"><strong>&bull; </strong>Massage therapists</td>\r\n<td class=\"column-2\">3220