INSERT INTO `program` (`id`, `title`, `url_link`, `metadata`, `program_detail`, `Image`, `image_alt`, `deatil_image`, `detail_image_alt`, `country`, `program_form`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(1, 'Australian Skilled Worker\r\n', '/service/australian-immigration-services/australian-skilled-worker/', '<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\">\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Discover the benefits and eligibility criteria for Australian skilled worker visas, including the Skilled Independent Visa (189), Skilled Nominated Visa (190), and Skilled Work Regional Visa (491). Trust Lalani Associates to guide you through the Australian immigration process.\">\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/australian-immigration-services/australian-skilled-worker/\">\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\">\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\">\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Australian Skilled Worker - Lalani Associates\">\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Discover the benefits and eligibility criteria for Australian skilled worker visas, including the Skilled Independent Visa (189), Skilled Nominated Visa (190), and Skilled Work Regional Visa (491). Trust Lalani Associates to guide you through the Australian immigration process.\">\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/australian-immigration-services/australian-skilled-worker/\">\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\">\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\">\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-06-04T06:08:29+00:00\">\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\"\r\ncontent=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725364304_1725342564_1724736982_Australia_Image.webp\">\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1342\">\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"896\">\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\">\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\">\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\">\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"4 minutes\">\r\n', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">Independent Migrant 189 Visa</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p>The Skilled Independent Visa is a permanent visa that grants individuals the opportunity to reside and work in Australia. Skilled professionals can apply for Australian immigration through this visa category, based on their qualifications and the demand for their occupation on the Skilled Occupation List (SOL), which identifies occupations experiencing a shortage in Australia.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<h4><strong>Advantages</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Advantages of the Independent Visa include the ability to both study and work in Australia, multiple entries and exits from the country, potential eligibility for Australian citizenship, the opportunity to sponsor eligible family members for permanent residency, and the option to bring your family to Australia.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<h4><strong>Eligibility</strong></h4>\r\n<p>To be eligible for the 189 Visa, applicants must achieve a minimum score of 65 points. Points can be earned based on various factors such as age, English language proficiency, educational qualifications, employment opportunities for skilled workers, and other relevant factors. It is important to ensure that your profession is listed on the appropriate Skilled Occupation List and pass the skilled migration points test. Additionally, for your occupation, you must undergo a skills assessment with the appropriate evaluating authority. You must also submit an Expression of Interest, and upon receiving an invitation, you can proceed with the application process. Other requirements include being between the ages of 18 and 44 and meeting the basic standards for Skilled Migration, including proficiency in English, satisfactory health status, and good character records.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">Skilled Nominated Visa 190</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p>The Skilled Nominated Visa category, also known as Subclass 190, is designed to address the high demand for certain occupations in specific states or territories of Australia. This visa program grants permanent residency to individuals who are invited to apply. Successful applicants can enjoy the benefits of living and working in Australia, pursuing educational opportunities, and engaging in other activities of interest. To apply for the Skilled Nominated Visa, interested individuals must first complete an Expression of Interest (EOI) and submit it to the Department of Home Affairs. The Skill Select system accepts EOI applications throughout the year in Australia. Applicants receive points based on their EOI, and those with high-ranking EOIs are invited to apply for the visa.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<h4><strong>Advantages</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Advantages of the Skilled Nominated Visa include the ability to stay in Australia, work and study in the country, access Medicare coverage for healthcare expenses, potentially apply for Australian citizenship if eligible, sponsor eligible family members for permanent residency, and have the freedom to travel across Australia after spending the initial two years in the nominating territory.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<h4><strong>Eligibility</strong></h4>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\">To be eligible for the Subclass 190 Visa, the following requirements must be met:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1) <span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">Age</span></strong><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">:</span> Applicants must be under the age of 45 when submitting the EOI.<br><strong>2) <span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">Skill Evaluation</span></strong><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">:</span> A skill evaluation must be obtained and approved.<br><strong>3) <span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">Occupation Demand</span></strong><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">:</span> The nominated occupation must be in demand, as indicated by the occupation list.<br><strong>4) <span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">Health Requirements</span></strong><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">:</span> Both the applicant and any accompanying family members must meet the health requirements.<br><strong>5) <span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">English Language Proficiency</span></strong><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">:</span> Applicants must demonstrate fluency and proficiency in English at the time of application.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">Skilled Work Regional Visa 491</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p>The Skilled Regional Visa is designed for skilled individuals who have been nominated by a state or government to live and work in regional areas of Australia.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<h4><strong>Advantages</strong></h4>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\">Key Advantages of the Skilled Regional Visa:</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>&bull;</strong></span> Reside in Australia for a period of 5 years<br><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>&bull;</strong></span> Study and work in regional Australia<br><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>&bull;</strong></span> Travel in and out of Australia multiple times</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<h4><strong>Eligibility</strong></h4>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\">Eligibility Requirements for this Visa:</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">&bull;</span> Nomination/Sponsorship</strong>:<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;To apply for this visa, you must possess the relevant skills and be nominated by the Australian Government or sponsored by an eligible relative.</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">&bull;</span> Skill Assessment</strong>:<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;It is essential to have undergone a suitable skill assessment at the time of receiving the invitation.</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">&bull;</span> Score of 65 Points or Above:</strong><br>&nbsp; &nbsp;You must obtain a minimum score of 65 points, which can be earned based on factors such as age, English language proficiency, qualifications, work experience, and other relevant factors.</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">&bull;</span> Age Requirement</strong>:<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;You must be under the age of 45 at the time of receiving the invitation to apply for the visa.</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">&bull;</span> Additional Factors</strong>:<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;The Department will also assess various aspects, including your English language proficiency, health status, and character history, among others.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725364304_1725342564_1724736982_Australia_Image.webp', 'Australian Skilled Worker Program', 'uploads/1725428593_Australia.webp', 'Australian Skilled Worker', 'Australia', 'detail_form', '2024-07-01 04:41:55', '2024-10-23 06:09:47');
INSERT INTO `program` (`id`, `title`, `url_link`, `metadata`, `program_detail`, `Image`, `image_alt`, `deatil_image`, `detail_image_alt`, `country`, `program_form`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(2, 'Start-up Visa Program – Best route to Canada in 3 years\r\n', '/service/canadian-immigration-services/start-up-visa-program/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Learn about the Canadian Start-up Visa Program (SUV) launched by the Canadian government, offering opportunities for innovative entrepreneurs to build businesses in Canada. Discover eligibility requirements, application process, processing time, and legal fees with Lalani Associates.\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/canadian-immigration-services/start-up-visa-program/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Start-up Visa Program - Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Learn about the Canadian Start-up Visa Program (SUV) launched by the Canadian government, offering opportunities for innovative entrepreneurs to build businesses in Canada. Discover eligibility requirements, application process, processing time, and legal fees with Lalani Associates.\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/canadian-immigration-services/start-up-visa-program/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-06-04T06:12:31+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725342627_1719809628_Start-up-Visa-Program-3.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1342\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"896\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"3 minutes\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<h4 id=\"1-general-overview\" class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">1.&nbsp;<strong>General Overview</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p>The Canadian government launched the&nbsp;<strong>Start-up Visa Program&nbsp;</strong>(SUV) in 2013. This provide great opportunities for entrepreneurs possessing the skills and potential to build businesses in Canada that are:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Innovative,</li>\r\n<li>can create jobs for Canadians,</li>\r\n<li>And has the potential to compete on a global scale.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>The program&rsquo;s objective is to provide encouragement and support to talented entrepreneurs who express an interest in launching a business. This provides a way not only to stimulate the Canadian economy but also generate ample employment opportunities for Canadians.</p>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<p>The applicant with innovative business ideas needs support from any one of the following Canadian Government&rsquo;s authorizedDesignated Organizations:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Angel investor groups</li>\r\n<li>Venture capital fund</li>\r\n<li>Business incubators</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>A designated angel investor group must confirm that it is investing at least&nbsp;<strong>$75,000</strong>&nbsp;into the qualifying business. A designated<strong>&nbsp;</strong>venture capital fund&rsquo;s requirement is&nbsp;<strong>$200,000</strong>. A business incubator program does not require a minimum investment, and its acceptance serves as its commitment.<br><br></p>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\"><br><br></div>\r\n<h4 id=\"2-eligibility-requirements-for-applicants\" class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">2.&nbsp;<strong>Eligibility requirements for applicants</strong></span></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Owns a qualifying business. Applicants, whether alone or as a group (up to 5), must own more than 50% share of the business. However, each applicant&rsquo;s share must not be less than 10% with voting rights.</li>\r\n<li>The business should be incorporated in Canada.</li>\r\n<li>Essential part of the operations of the business happens in Canada.</li>\r\n<li>Provide active and ongoing management of this business from within Canada.</li>\r\n<li>Get a letter of support from a DO. This could be either a Venture capital fund, Angel investorgroup, or Business incubator<strong><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Business_incubator\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Business_incubator\">.</a></strong></li>\r\n<li>Meet the minimum language requirements of at least&nbsp;<strong>CLB</strong>&nbsp;5 either English or French.</li>\r\n<li>Bring enough moneyto settle in<strong>&nbsp;</strong>Canadawith their families (under&nbsp;<strong>$50,000</strong>&nbsp;in most cases)</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<h4 id=\"3-start-up-applicaiton-process\" class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">3.&nbsp;<strong>Start-up Applicaiton Process</strong></span></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Initially, assessing the candidate&rsquo;s eligibility for the&nbsp;<strong>Start-up Visa Program</strong>&nbsp;(SUV) requires their detailed information.</li>\r\n<li>Our professional team identifies the right projects for the applicant. The team also identifies the partners required to complete the group for the Start-up.</li>\r\n<li>Our team updates the applicant of the innovation, marketing, production, job creation, and financial dimensions of the project. The project will allocate each member a respective position, outlining their future responsibilities in key areas.</li>\r\n<li>A Federal Corporation is created under the Canada Business Corporations Act for the identified project. 10% shareholding is allocated as per the understanding and requirements of the program rules given to each applicant.</li>\r\n<li>After the preparation of a thorough business plan, the idea is presented to the AI / VC for approval. Once submitted, the AI / VC may wish to communicate with the entrepreneur applicant(s) to discuss the project. Our team will ensure that the applicant is ready and prepared for those discussions. Once AI and VC are approved, it will commit $ 75,000 and $ 200,000, resp, to the project.</li>\r\n<li>Upon the acceptance of the project, the AI/ VC issues a Letter of Support (LOS) to the applicant.</li>\r\n<li>After LOS, our team will prepare the application for Permanent Residence. Biometric, medical examination and police clearance certificates may be required.</li>\r\n<li>Once landed each applicant has to file a monitoring report after 6 months on the progress of their activities.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<h4 id=\"4-processing-time\" class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>4. Processing Time</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p>The processing time for the application is around 30 to 36 months. This includes time to give Biometrics.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<h4 id=\"5-legal-and-professional-fee\" class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">5.&nbsp;<strong>Legal and professional fee</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p>The legal and professional fee for the Angel Investor and Venture Capital streams ranges between USD 150,000 and USD 175,000. This fee covers services provided and includes a minimum equity shareholding of 10% in the company.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><em>For more details please&nbsp;<a href=\"../contact/\">contact our senior immigration consultants and advisors.</a></em></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725342627_1719809628_Start-up-Visa-Program-3.webp', 'Canada Start-up Visa Program', 'uploads/1725428574_1722681687_Start-up-Visa-Program.webp', 'Canada Start-up Visa Program – Best route to Canada in 3 years', 'Canada', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 04:53:48', '2024-09-04 06:56:44');
INSERT INTO `program` (`id`, `title`, `url_link`, `metadata`, `program_detail`, `Image`, `image_alt`, `deatil_image`, `detail_image_alt`, `country`, `program_form`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(3, 'USA E2 – Employment Second Preference\r\n', '/service/united-states/usa-e2-employment-second-preference/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Explore the USA E2 - Employment Second Preference visa benefits for entrepreneurs. Get help from immigration consultants in Pakistan.\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/united-states/usa-e2-employment-second-preference/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"USA E2 - Employment Second Preference - Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Explore the USA E2 - Employment Second Preference visa benefits for entrepreneurs. Get help from immigration consultants in Pakistan.\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/united-states/usa-e2-employment-second-preference/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-04-20T04:15:01+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725342642_1719811154_USA-Image-01%20(1).webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1342\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"896\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"3 minutes\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<h2 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Benefits of the USA E2 Employment Second Preference Visa</strong></span></h2>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The&nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States\">USA</a>&nbsp;E2 Employment Second Preference visa is a non-immigrant visa that allows foreign entrepreneurs to enter and work in the United States. This visa is an excellent option for investors, executives, and other highly skilled workers who are looking to establish a business in the United States. In this article, we will discuss everything you need to know about the USA E2 visa.<br><br>First, it is essential to note that the USA E2 visa is only available to nationals of specific countries that have bilateral investment treaties with the United States. To qualify for the visa, applicants must be able to demonstrate that they have invested or are actively in the process of investing a substantial amount of funds in a US business.<br><br>Another essential aspect of the USA E2 Employment Second Preference visa is that it allows for the visa holder&rsquo;s spouse and dependents to join them in the United States. The spouse of a USA E2 visa holder may apply for employment authorization and work in the United States while any dependent children of the visa holder may attend school in the USA on this visa.<br><br>To apply for the USA E2 visa, the applicant must submit a comprehensive business plan that outlines their proposed US-based investment project. The business plan should be detailed, provide technical specifications, and financial projections. Additionally, the applicant must provide evidence that they have obtained the required investment capital or are in the process of obtaining it. Overall, a successful visa application will show that the investment project is viable and will create employment opportunities in the United States.<br><br>The USA E2 visa is not a permanent residency visa, and as such, the visa holder must regularly renew the visa. The visa is typically granted for a period of two to five years, depending on the Immigration officer&rsquo;s discretion. However, the visa holder may renew their visa an unlimited number of times, provided they continue to meet the visa criteria.<br><br>One of the advantages of the USA E2 visa is that there is no specific minimum investment amount required by law. However, the US government has generally set a benchmark of around $100,000 to $200,000 as the minimum investment. Additionally, the visa requires the applicant to have a controlling interest in the US business they wish to establish.</p>\r\n<p class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Investment Requirement:</strong></span></p>\r\n<br>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Investor must be a national of one of the treaty countries (i.e., Pakistan is a treaty country) in order to be admitted to the United States.</li>\r\n<li>The US Government does not specify a minimum amount for investment; however, the investment amount must be substantial i.e., the investment amount must be proportionate to the nature of business proposed.</li>\r\n<li>Investor must own at least 51% of the enterprise or possess authority over operations through senior managerial position.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\">\r\n<p class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Benefits:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Establish, direct and operate the proposed business in the United States.</li>\r\n<li>Spouse of E2 investor shall be granted E2 dependent visa through which he/she may obtain temporary work permit or employment authorization document (EAD).</li>\r\n<li>Children under 21 years of age shall also be granted E2 dependent visa allowing them to attend school of their choice in the United States.\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Visa Validity:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>E2 visa holders shall be allowed a maximum of two years stay in the United States initially.</li>\r\n<li>E2 visa holders may request for extension in visa and obtain increment of up to two years. (There is no maximum limit for the number of extensions).</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p class=\"has-text-color\"><br><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Eligible Family Members:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Spouse</li>\r\n<li>Children below the age of 21 years<br><br><em>For more details please&nbsp;<a href=\"../contact/\">contact our senior immigration consultants and advisors.</a></em></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725342642_1719811154_USA-Image-01 (1).webp', 'USA E2 Visa Program', 'uploads/1725428505_usa3.webp', 'USA E2 – Employment Second Preference', 'USA', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 05:19:14', '2024-10-02 09:22:31');
INSERT INTO `program` (`id`, `title`, `url_link`, `metadata`, `program_detail`, `Image`, `image_alt`, `deatil_image`, `detail_image_alt`, `country`, `program_form`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(4, 'St Kitts & Nevis Citizenship By Investment\r\n', '/service/caribbean-immigration-services/st-kitts-nevis-citizenship-by-investment/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Discover the easy St. Kitts & Nevis Citizenship By Investment process with our visa consultants. Get citizenship in months and travel visa-free to 150+ countries, including the UK and Schengen Zone.\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/caribbean-immigration-services/st-kitts-nevis-citizenship-by-investment/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"St Kitts & Nevis Citizenship By Investment - Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Discover the easy St. Kitts & Nevis Citizenship By Investment process with our visa consultants. Get citizenship in months and travel visa-free to 150+ countries, including the UK and Schengen Zone.\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/caribbean-immigration-services/st-kitts-nevis-citizenship-by-investment/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-04-20T04:49:17+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725342669_1719811283_Caribbean-Image-01.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1342\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"896\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"2 minutes\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<h2 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Streamlined St. Kitts &amp; Nevis Citizenship By Investment Process</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p>St Kitts &amp; Nevis Citizenship By Investment, located in the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caribbean\">Caribbean</a>, is a scenic set of islands that are becoming increasingly popular for those seeking a second residence or citizenship. Through the Citizenship by Investment program (CBI), individuals can obtain citizenship and access the many opportunities that come with it.<br><br>One of the most appealing aspects of the St Kitts &amp; Nevis Citizenship By Investment CBI program is that it is highly efficient. Applicants can receive citizenship within just a few months, a process that typically takes years in other countries. Furthermore, there is no requirement for residency or language proficiency, making it an easy process for foreigners.<br><br>The financial requirements for obtaining St Kitts &amp; Nevis Citizenship By Investment through CBI are also quite reasonable. The program requires either a donation to the Sugar Industry Diversification Fund or investment in real estate. The donation amount starts at $150,000 for a single applicant and $195,000 for a family of up to four. Real estate investment requires a minimum of $200,000, which can be sold after five years. Overall, compared to other CBI programs, the financial investment required is relatively low.<br><br><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">Investment requirement:</strong></span></p>\r\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><cite>The applicant must either opt for ONE of the following:<br><br><strong>1. Real estate option:</strong> Minimum Investment of at least US $400,000 in real estate project.<br><br><strong>2. Sustainable Island State Contribution (SISC):</strong> Donation of US $ 250,000 for a family of Three. The donation amount increases according to the family composition.</cite></blockquote>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><strong>Citizenship:</strong>&nbsp;Direct citizenship &amp; Passport within 6 to 8 months.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<h3 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>St Kitts &amp; Nevis Benefits:</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visa free travel to 150+ Countries including UK, Schengen Zone</li>\r\n<li>No physical residency required</li>\r\n<li>Citizenship can be passed down by descent, so future generations can also benefit from this investment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<h3 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Eligible Family Members:</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Spouse</li>\r\n<li>Children under 18</li>\r\n<li>Children aged 18-25 (if they are current full-time students and unmarried).</li>\r\n<li>Financially dependent Parents/grandparents of Principal Applicant or spouse, age above 65</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><br>St. Kitts and Nevis CBI also offers ease of travel. Passport holders can travel visa-free to over 150 countries, including the United Kingdom, and the Schengen Area countries. This freedom of travel is highly desirable for those looking to expand their opportunities globally.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><em>For more details please&nbsp;<a href=\"../contact/\">contact our senior immigration consultants and advisors.</a></em></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725342669_1719811283_Caribbean-Image-01.webp', 'St Kitts & Nevis Citizenship By Investment Program', 'uploads/1725428413_St-Kitts-Nevis-Citizenship-By-Investment.webp', 'St Kitts & Nevis Citizenship By Investment', 'Caribbean', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 05:21:23', '2024-09-11 11:11:31');
INSERT INTO `program` (`id`, `title`, `url_link`, `metadata`, `program_detail`, `Image`, `image_alt`, `deatil_image`, `detail_image_alt`, `country`, `program_form`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(5, 'Portugal Golden Residence Visa\r\n', '/service/europe/portugal-golden-residence-visa-program/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Explore the Portugal Golden Visa program with Lalani & Associates. Secure your European residency and citizenship while enjoying a high quality of life.\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/europe/portugal-golden-residence-visa-program/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Moving to Europe: Find More About Portugal Golden Visa\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Explore the Portugal Golden Visa program with Lalani & Associates. Secure your European residency and citizenship while enjoying a high quality of life.\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/europe/portugal-golden-residence-visa-program/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-04-20T05:51:20+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725342685_1719811486_Europe-Image-01.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1342\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"896\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"1 minute\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow AIPRM__conversation__response\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words text-start [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"d5b1172c-e4e3-4551-9062-9d2f22543aaa\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\">\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-size: 18pt; color: #c1915b;\"><strong>Portugal Golden Visa: Want to Get Your European Citizenship?</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p>Let your goal be opportunities because, at Lalani &amp; Associates, your next step for European economic residency and citizenship is to apprentice to our wisdom. The <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portugal\">Portugal</a> Golden Visa is ideal for individuals and families looking for a foothold in Europe, providing a delightful blend of lifestyle, liberty, and investment potential.</p>\r\n<p><strong>In the Golden Residence program of Portugal, the additional benefits besides luxury living are a secure life and a great business opportunity.</strong></p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">➤ </span>Portugal Golden Visa Program: What is it?</strong></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">To attract investors into the country, the government of Portugal has endorsed the Portugal Golden Visa scheme. Resident visas are available for qualified investors who are non-EU nationals, providing a pathway to full citizenship after five years.</span></p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">➤&nbsp;</span></strong><strong>How Does the Golden Visa Work?</strong></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Under the Golden Visa program, beneficiaries are required to invest in Portugal&rsquo;s economy, granting them and their dependents the right to reside, work, and study in Portugal, as well as unrestricted travel within the Schengen Zone.</span></p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">➤&nbsp;</span></strong><strong>Key Features of Portugal&rsquo;s Golden Visa</strong></h3>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Portugal Golden Residence Visa is a gateway to a life of liberty and opportunity in one of Europe&rsquo;s most promising locations. The key features recommending this program to global investors around the world are below:</span></p>\r\n<h4><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">▲</span> </span>Low Residency Requirements</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Other residency programs may require one to reside in the country for a long time. Still, with the Portugal Golden Visa program, citizenship is granted after just 7 days a year in Portugal.</p>\r\n<h4><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">▲</span>&nbsp;</span>Choices in Investment</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Investors can select various alternatives such as real estate investment, capital transfer, or a lesser-known option of investing in research activities that suit their capacity and area of interest.</p>\r\n<h4><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">▲</span>&nbsp;</span>Family Reunification</strong></h4>\r\n<p>The program permits family members like spouses, dependent children, and parents to be included so that all family members can benefit from the residency at the same time.</p>\r\n<h4><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">▲</span>&nbsp;</span>Visa-Free Travel</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Golden Visa holders can travel freely within the Schengen Zone, so European movement is greatly simplified.</p>\r\n<h4><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">▲</span>&nbsp;</span>Possibility of Acquiring Portuguese Citizenship</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Once the five-year longevity of the investment is satisfied and the residency obligation is fulfilled, investors are eligible to seek Portuguese citizenship, making it possible to have a European passport.</p>\r\n<h4><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">▲</span>&nbsp;</span>Living Standards</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Many people are drawn to reside in Portugal thanks to its high living standards, warmth, the welcoming nature of the people who live there, and the developed healthcare and educational systems.</p>\r\n<h4><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">▲</span>&nbsp;</span>Support in Achieving it Legally</strong></h4>\r\n<p>We at Lalani &amp; Associates specialize in providing all necessary services required to complete the Golden Visa application including the legal advice to file the application and real estate acquisition.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">➤&nbsp;</span></strong><strong>Portugal Golden Visa Benefits: Pros of This Program</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The Golden Residence Portugal Permit program is meant for people who want a comfortable lifestyle and, at the same time, want to enjoy the benefits of having a <a href=\"../service/european-immigration-services/\">European residency and citizenship</a>.</p>\r\n<h4><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">▲</span>&nbsp;</span>Minimum Advantages</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Investors benefit from the initial amount, and in cases of returns such as cross-investments, they are guaranteed free movement across European territories. They gain access to high-quality healthcare and educational services.</p>\r\n<h4><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">▲</span>&nbsp;</span>Benefits to Lifestyle &amp; Family</strong></h4>\r\n<p>This ensures that when investors benefit, their families also benefit. Family inclusion remains a key feature of the program, enabling the dependents to have a secure future.</p>\r\n<h4><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">▲</span>&nbsp;</span>Commercial and Financial Benefits</strong></h4>\r\n<p>This program provides commercial returns, such as returns on investment, which can be made through the numerous investment options that can add to the economy.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">➤&nbsp;</span></strong><strong>Investment Options for the Portugal Golden Visa</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The three main prerequisites to qualify for the Portugal Golden Visa include:</p>\r\n<h4><strong><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">✔</span> Real Estate Investment</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Investment in real estate, which is one of the most prominent areas. This sector comprises profitable investments in various forms, such as large-valued properties or renovation works.</p>\r\n<h4><strong><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">✔</span> Investment Funds</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Another way to qualify for the program is by investing in private equity commitments or venture capital funds directed to any of the key sectors of the Portuguese economy.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">➤&nbsp;</span></strong> <strong>Here are some options to choose from:</strong></h3>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; <span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">Private Equity Investment Funds:</span></strong> A minimum investment of about &euro;500,000 in a qualifying Private Equity Investment Fund offers a chance to pool funds with other individuals to secure and handle private firms in Portugal. These assets or funds emphasize companies (having a higher growth potential) to accomplish profitable exits. It ends up offering significant returns on investment.</p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; <span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">Venture Capital Funds:</span></strong> Investing a minimum of &euro;170,000 in a Venture Capital fund can also secure a Golden Visa. These funds primarily target early-stage companies with significant growth potential, focusing on sectors that drive innovation and economic growth in Portugal. It&rsquo;s crucial to understand that these funds exclude any direct or indirect investments in real estate, ensuring a diversified investment portfolio.</p>\r\n<h4><strong><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">✔</span> Business Investment</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Investors may also own or partake in establishing a company based in Portugal and participate in job creation and economic development.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">➤&nbsp;</span></strong><strong>Applying for the Residence in Portugal: Golden Visa Program</strong></h3>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; &nbsp;</strong> &nbsp;Investors must meet specific investment, legal, and financial conditions and spend at least seven days per year in Portugal.<br><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; </strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;The process involves gathering necessary documents, making the investment, and completing all legal formalities with guidance from experts like Lalani &amp; Associates.<br><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&bull; </strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;The application timeline extends from submission to approval and may take several months, during which Lalani &amp; Associates provides continuous support.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">➤&nbsp;</span></strong><strong>Why Choose Lalani &amp; Associates for Your Golden Visa?</strong></h3>\r\n<p>We at Lalani &amp; Associates &ndash; the best visa consultants in Pakistan, advise on each of the numerous steps involved in obtaining Portugal&rsquo;s Golden Visa.</p>\r\n<h4><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">▲ </span></span></strong><strong>Expertise and Experience</strong></h4>\r\n<p>The team at Lalani &amp; Associates has years of practice, establishing their unquestionable credibility in navigating the Golden Visa process and ensuring successful applications.</p>\r\n<h4><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">▲&nbsp;</span></span></strong><strong>Personalized Consultation</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Each case receives tailored advice to strategically position your investment in promising real estate opportunities and facilitate the relocation process for families.</p>\r\n<h4><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">▲&nbsp;</span></span></strong><strong>Comprehensive Support</strong></h4>\r\n<p>From the first meeting to the visa acquisition and all other processes, Lalani &amp; Associates assists the customers throughout the whole process.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color: #c1915b;\">➤&nbsp;</span></strong><strong>Get Your European Legacy Secured Today!</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Lalani &amp; Associates offers individuals a valuable opportunity to migrate to Portugal for work, residence, or investment. Their expert assistance ensures a seamless experience, offering clear and comprehensive guidance that simplifies the process. With their efficient and streamlined approach, achieving your goals becomes quicker and easier than ever.<br><br><strong>Do you want to open the gateway to Europe? Contact us to discuss your Portugal Golden Visa and start your journey towards a brighter future in Europe.</strong></p>\r\n<hr style=\"border: 1px solid #000; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24pt; font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; color: #c1915b;\"><strong>Secure your legacy with just a click!</strong></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725342685_1719811486_Europe-Image-01.webp', 'Portugal Golden Visa ', 'uploads/1725428357_portugal.webp', 'Portugal Golden Residence Visa Program', 'Europe', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 05:24:46', '2024-12-09 05:44:44'),
(6, 'Turkey Citizenship By Investment Program\r\n', '/service/turkey-immigration-services/turkey-citizenship-by-investment-program/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Discover the Turkey Citizenship By Investment Program with Lalani Associates. the best immigration consultant in Pakistan.\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/turkey-immigration-services/turkey-citizenship-by-investment-program/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Turkey Citizenship By Investment Program - Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Discover Turkey Citizenship By Investment Program with Lalani Associates. Top immigration consultants in Pakistan.\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/turkey-immigration-services/turkey-citizenship-by-investment-program/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-04-20T06:48:47+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725342700_1719811588_Turkey-Image-01-01.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1342\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"896\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"2 minutes\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<p>The Turkish Citizenship-by-Investment Program has emerged as one of the most affordable and attractive options for those seeking a second citizenship through property investment.<br><br>Turkey is a transcontinental country that straddles both Europe and Asia, and its strategic location has made it a hub for commerce, culture, and history for thousands of years. Today, Turkey is classified as one of the fastest-growing economies in the world, and it boasts a thriving real estate sector that has been attracting an increasing number of foreign investors in recent years.<br><br>The Turkish Citizenship-by-Investment Program is designed to encourage foreign direct investment in the country&rsquo;s real estate market, which in turn will contribute significantly to Turkey&rsquo;s economic growth and development. The program offers a straightforward and streamlined process for interested investors who wish to obtain Turkish citizenship by investing in a property in Turkey.<br><br>One of the most significant advantages of the Turkish Citizenship-by-Investment Program is its affordability. The program requires interested applicants to invest a minimum of $400,000 USD in a real estate asset in Turkey. This investment can be made in a single property or multiple properties, as long as the total investment amount meets the required threshold.<br><br>In addition to the potential for long-term capital growth and rental income, foreign investors who obtain Turkish citizenship through the program also enjoy a range of benefits, including visa-free travel to more than 110 countries, health and education benefits similar to those of Turkish citizens, and the ability to extend citizenship to family members.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Investment Requirements:</strong></span><br>1. USD $400,000 in real estate.<br><br><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Benefits:</strong></span><br>1. Visa free/Visa on arrival/E-visa to 115 countries<br>2. No physical residency required</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Eligible Family Members:</strong></span><br>1. Spouse<br>2. Children up to 18 years of age</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725342700_1719811588_Turkey-Image-01-01.webp', 'Turkey Citizenship By Investment Program', 'uploads/1725428305_Turkey.webp', 'Turkey Citizenship By Investment', 'Turkey', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 05:26:28', '2024-09-04 06:59:45'),
(7, 'Canada Temporary Residence Visa\r\n', '/service/canadian-immigration-services/canada-temporary-residence/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Explore the Canada Temporary Residence Visa process and requirements. Learn about visitor visas, study permits, and work permits for temporary stays in Canada.\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/canadian-immigration-services/canada-temporary-residence/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Canada Temporary Residence Visa - Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Explore the Canada Temporary Residence Visa process and requirements. Learn about visitor visas, study permits, and work permits for temporary stays in Canada.\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/canadian-immigration-services/canada-temporary-residence/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-04-18T06:04:06+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725342719_1719812095_Canada-Image-08.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1342\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"896\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"2 minutes\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<h3 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Canada Temporary Residence</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p>Canada is a popular destination for temporary residents, attracting millions of visitors each year. The country&rsquo;s thriving economy, excellent healthcare system, and welcoming atmosphere make it an attractive option for people from all over the world. If you&rsquo;re interested in visiting Canada for a short-term stay, you&rsquo;ll need to apply for a Canada Temporary Residence Visa.<br><br>A Canada Temporary Residence Visa is a document that allows you to enter Canada and stay for a limited time. There are several types of temporary residency visas, including visitor visas, study permits, and work permits. Each type of visa has its own requirements and application process. However, they all require that you meet certain eligibility criteria.<br><br>To apply for a Canada Temporary Residence Visa, you&rsquo;ll need to complete an application form and provide supporting documents. The required documents will depend on the type of visa you&rsquo;re applying for. Generally, you&rsquo;ll need to provide proof of your identity, your travel plans, and your finances. You may also need to provide medical and police clearance certificates.<br><br>The length of your stay in Canada will depend on the type of visa you have. Visitor visas are typically valid for up to six months, while study and work permits may be valid for several months or years. It&rsquo;s important to note that you cannot extend your stay in Canada beyond the expiry date of your visa or permit. If you want to stay longer, you&rsquo;ll need to apply for an extension.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Processing Time:</strong>&nbsp;4 Months</span></p>\r\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<cite>Visitors are persons who are not Canadian citizens or permanent residents of Canada, and are legally authorized to enter Canada for specific purpose. Visitors are restricted in length of stay and subject to various conditions.</cite></blockquote>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Following are the requirements for Canada Temporary Residence Visa:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>No intention to work or study in Canada unless authorized to do so</li>\r\n<li>Defined purpose of Travel</li>\r\n<li>Have sufficient funds available and ties to their home country such as a job, family or property</li>\r\n<li>Be a law-abiding citizen with no criminal record and Not be a risk to the security of&nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canada\">Canada</a></li>\r\n<li>Be in good health and willing to complete a medical examination</li>\r\n<li>Satisfy visa officer that you will leave Canada at the end of your authorized stay</li>\r\n<li>The applicant&rsquo;s family member in Canada can be an added advantage<br><br><em>For more details please&nbsp;<a href=\"../contact/\">contact our senior immigration consultants and advisors.</a></em></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725342719_1719812095_Canada-Image-08.webp', 'Canada Visit Visa Program', 'uploads/1725428234_Canada-Temporary-Residence-Visa.webp', 'Canada Temporary Residence Visa', 'Canada', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 05:34:55', '2024-09-04 07:00:17'),
(8, 'Sponsoring your Spouse Partner or Dependent child\r\n', '/service/canadian-immigration-services/sponsoring-your-spouse-partner-or-dependent-child/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Sponsoring your spouse partner or dependent child If you are a permanent resident, to sponsor your spouse you must be living in Canada\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/canadian-immigration-services/sponsoring-your-spouse-partner-or-dependent-child/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Sponsoring your Spouse Partner or Dependent child\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Sponsoring your spouse partner or dependent child If you are a permanent resident, to sponsor your spouse you must be living in Canada\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/canadian-immigration-services/sponsoring-your-spouse-partner-or-dependent-child/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-04-18T06:00:44+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725342752_1719812324_Canada-Image-07.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1342\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"896\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"1 minute\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<h2 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Introduction:</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p>Sponsoring your spouse partner or dependent child to join you in Canada is a fulfilling way to keep your family together. Discover the process and requirements for family sponsorship in Canada.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Canadian spousal sponsorship is how a Canadian citizen or permanent resident can sponsor their partner to come to Canada and live permanently. Canada knows how important it is for families to be together. For this reason, applications for&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/application/application-forms-guides/guide-5289-sponsor-your-spouse-common-law-partner-conjugal-partner-dependent-child-complete-guide.html\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/application/application-forms-guides/guide-5289-sponsor-your-spouse-common-law-partner-conjugal-partner-dependent-child-complete-guide.html\">spousal sponsorship</a>&nbsp;are considered a top priority.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>To Sponsoring your spouse partner or dependent child you must fulfill the following requirements:</p>\r\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\">\r\n<h3 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Requirement:</strong></span></h3>\r\n<cite>1. You must be a Canadian Citizen or a Permanent Resident<br>2. The sponsor must be 18 years of age or older<br>3. If you are a permanent resident, to sponsor your spouse you must be living in Canada<br>4. Being a Canadian resident and living outside Canada you can apply for Spousal Sponsorship; however, you must show the plan of yours to live in Canada with your spouse to meet requirements for sponsoring your spouse once your spouse gets the permanent residency<br>5. You must also need to prove that you can easily meet basic needs and manage basic expenses of yourself, your spouse and dependent children (if any)</cite></blockquote>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<p><em>For more details please&nbsp;<a href=\"../contact/\">contact our senior immigration consultants and advisors.</a></em></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725342752_1719812324_Canada-Image-07.webp', 'Canada Spousal Visa Program', 'uploads/Sponsoring-your-spouse-partner-or-dependent-child.jpg', 'Canada Sponsoring your Spouse Partner or Dependent child', 'Canada', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 05:38:44', '2024-09-04 07:00:51'),
(9, 'Hungary PR Renewal\r\n', '/service/europe/hungary-pr-renewal/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Renew your Hungary PR Renewal hassle-free with expert assistance from our visa and immigration consultants in Pakistan.\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/europe/hungary-pr-renewal/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Hungary PR Renewal - Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Renew your Hungary PR Renewal hassle-free with expert assistance from our visa and immigration consultants in Pakistan.\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/europe/hungary-pr-renewal/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-04-20T06:43:34+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725342802_Europe%20Image-05.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1343\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"897\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"1 minute\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<p>In Hungary, permanent residence permits are issued for an indefinite period of time, but they need to be renewed periodically. The renewal process must be initiated at least 30 days before the expiration date of the current permit.<br><br>To renew your permanent residence permit in Hungary, you will need to submit an application to the Immigration and Asylum Office. The application must include the following documents:</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1. A completed application form</li>\r\n<li>2. A valid passport</li>\r\n<li>3. A proof of payment of the renewal fee</li>\r\n<li>4. A proof of your current address in Hungary</li>\r\n<li>5. A certificate of clean criminal record issued by the authorities of your country of origin or the country where you have lived for the last year</li>\r\n<li>6. A proof of health insurance coverage in Hungary</li>\r\n<li>7. A certificate of sufficient financial means to support yourself in Hungary</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The exact requirements and documents may vary depending on your individual situation, and you may also be required to attend an interview with the immigration authorities.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725342802_Europe Image-05.webp', 'Hungary PR Renewal Program', 'uploads/1725429460_Hungary.webp', 'Hungary PR Renewal', 'Europe', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 05:42:08', '2024-09-04 07:01:28');
INSERT INTO `program` (`id`, `title`, `url_link`, `metadata`, `program_detail`, `Image`, `image_alt`, `deatil_image`, `detail_image_alt`, `country`, `program_form`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(10, 'Quebec Immigrant Investor Program – QIIP\r\n', '/service/canadian-immigration-services/quebec-immigrant-investor-program/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Discover Quebec Immigrant Investor Program for immigration to Quebec, Canada as an investor. Eligibility, benefits, and application.\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/canadian-immigration-services/quebec-immigrant-investor-program/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Quebec Immigrant Investor Program - QIIP - Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Discover Quebec Immigrant Investor Program for immigration to Quebec, Canada as an investor. Eligibility, benefits, and application.\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/canadian-immigration-services/quebec-immigrant-investor-program/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-04-18T08:03:42+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725342821_1719813166_Canada-Image-04.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1342\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"897\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"3 minutes\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<h4 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Quebec Immigrant Investor Program</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Introduction</strong>:</span></h4>\r\n<p>The&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.canadavisa.com/qiip.html\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://www.canadavisa.com/qiip.html\">Quebec Immigrant Investor</a> Program (QIIP) is one of Canada&rsquo;s most popular investor immigration programs. The program, started in 1986, attracts high-net-worth individuals to invest and settle in Quebec, strengthening its economy.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The Quebec Immigrant Investor Program (QIIP) attracts businessmen, executives, and officials to settle in Quebec. It offers immediate permanent residency in Canada, allowing them to live, work, and study anywhere in the country. Quebec&rsquo;s high standard of living, education, healthcare, and multicultural environment are additional attractions for immigrants.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Another great advantage of the QIIP is that it does not require applicants to speak French, unlike other Quebec immigration programs. However, knowledge of French is a significant asset and can facilitate integration into the Quebecois community.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>In addition to the financial benefits, the QIIP also provides applicants with a favorable tax regime. Quebec offers several tax incentives to investors, including lower tax rates on dividends and capital gains and various deductions on personal and corporate income taxes.<br><br><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\"><br><br></p>\r\n<span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Application Eligibility Requirement:</strong></span>\r\n<p>To qualify for the QIIP, applicants need a minimum net worth of CAD 2 million, possess at least two years of recent business or management experience, and be ready to invest CAD 1.2 million in a government-approved project. The investment is refundable after five years. Applicants must also be willing to undertake a medical exam and a criminal background check as part of the application process.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Eligible Family Members:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Spouse<br>Children below the age of 22 years</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Investment Requirement:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>After application acceptance, applicant will have 2 options as follows: either<br>a) Full investment option: make a deposit to Quebec Immigration (MIFI) of CAD 1,200,000 for 5 years. The QIIP guarantees the return of the deposit after five years.</p>\r\n<p><br>b) Financing option through a Canadian bank: payment of one-time cost of CAD 360,000 (subject to prevailing interest rates). This payment is not refundable.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Citizenship Requirements:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>To maintain permanent residency, individuals must physically reside in Canada for a minimum of three years within the past five years. Adults must actively pass a citizenship test and demonstrate sufficient English or French proficiency. Typically, when one parent acquires citizenship, children under 18 become eligible for citizenship as well. Children over 18 must fulfill citizenship requirements.</p>\r\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\">\r\n<p class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">Benefits of QIIP:</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<cite>1. Direct immigration route available to Permanent Residency of Canada from Pakistan.<br>2. Investor and their families will get a higher standard for living, get world class education with tuition fee reduced as low as to one-fourth as Permanent Residents of Canada in public schools, and advanced health-care facilities covering social insurance plans<br>3. Immigrants and their family members can have international travel mobility after obtaining citizenship</cite></blockquote>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725342821_1719813166_Canada-Image-04.webp', 'Canada Quebec Immigrant Investor Program – QIIP', 'uploads/1725429208_Quebec-Immigrant-Investor-Program-QIIP.webp', 'Canada Quebec Immigrant Investor Program', 'Canada', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 05:52:46', '2024-09-04 07:02:08');
INSERT INTO `program` (`id`, `title`, `url_link`, `metadata`, `program_detail`, `Image`, `image_alt`, `deatil_image`, `detail_image_alt`, `country`, `program_form`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(11, 'Super Visa Canada\r\n', '/service/canadian-immigration-services/super-visa/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Discover Super Visa Canada for parents and grandparents of Canadians. Find out about eligibility and insurance.\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/canadian-immigration-services/super-visa/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Super Visa Canada - Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Discover Super Visa Canada for parents and grandparents of Canadians. Find out about eligibility and insurance.\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/canadian-immigration-services/super-visa/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-04-18T05:50:54+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725342837_1719813263_Canada-Image-05.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1342\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"897\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"3 minutes\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<p>A Super Visa Canada is a relatively new immigration initiative by the Canadian government to reunite families. Introduced in December 2011, it is a long-term visa that allows parents and grandparents of Canadian citizens or permanent residents to visit them for up to five years at a single stretch, and stay in the country for up to tens years without renewing their visa. The idea behind Super Visa is to extend the benefits of family reunification without adding too much burden on social services in the country, as well as facilitate Canadian businesses by allowing parents and grandparents of immigrants to invest in the Canadian economy.<br><br></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\"><br><br>The Super Visa program is a clear indication of the Canadian government&rsquo;s intention to keep families together. A recent report by Canada&rsquo;s Minister of Immigration estimated that, by 2036, 13 million working-age Canadians will have retired, most of whom will need support from their families as they age. The report also emphasized the positive impact of family reunification on the well-being and acculturation of new immigrants. Hence, Super Visa is not only a visa program, but a long-term social policy to ensure that Canadian families remain intact.<br><br>The process of applying for a Super Visa may seem daunting, but with the help of a licensed immigration consultant or lawyer, it can be relatively easy. The eligibility criteria for Super Visa requires that the applicant be a parent or grandparent of a Canadian citizen or permanent resident, prove that they have sufficient funds to support themselves in Canada and meet some of the other requirements. These requirements include a clean medical history and adequate medical insurance coverage while in Canada.<br><br>The medical insurance coverage is one of the most important requirements for Super Visa applications. It is mandatory for applicants to prove that they have private medical insurance from a Canadian insurance company that is valid for a minimum of one year, and covers at least CAD 100,000 in case of emergency medical needs. This is because Super Visa holders are not covered under Canada&rsquo;s public health care system, but are expected to make their own arrangements for medical needs, even in emergency situations. Additionally, Super Visa holders are expected to leave Canada within the validity period of their visa, which is usually 10 years, to maintain their status.<br><br>Super Visa provides a fantastic opportunity for families to be with their loved ones, even if they have not migrated to Canada. The program is highly popular and highly esteemed, as it allows parents and grandparents of immigrants to stay in Canada for an extended period, which contributes to the social fabric of society as well as the development of the Canadian economy. It would be an understatement to say that Super Visa is a game-changer for all parties involved: it is truly exceptional.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<h3 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Eligibility for Super Visa</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p>To be eligible to apply for Super Visa, you must meet the criteria:</p>\r\n<p>1.Be a parent or grandparent of a Canadian citizen or permanent resident.<br>2. Have sufficient funds available and ties to their home country such as a job, family or property.<br>3. Be in good health and willing to complete an upfront medical examination.<br>4. Obtain medical insurance (Min Coverage CAD $ 100,000) from a Canadian insurance company having a validity of at least one year.<br>5. Invitation Letter from your child or grandchild, who is inviting you to&nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canada\">Canada</a>.<br>6. Proof that your child or grandchild&rsquo;s household meets the minimum necessary income.</p>\r\n<p><br><em>For more details please&nbsp;<a href=\"../contact/\">contact our senior immigration consultants and advisors.</a></em></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725342837_1719813263_Canada-Image-05.webp', 'Super Visa Canada Program', 'uploads/Super-Visa-Canada.jpg', 'Super Visa Canada', 'Canada', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 05:54:23', '2024-09-04 07:03:42');
INSERT INTO `program` (`id`, `title`, `url_link`, `metadata`, `program_detail`, `Image`, `image_alt`, `deatil_image`, `detail_image_alt`, `country`, `program_form`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(12, 'Intra Company Transfer (ICT)\r\n', '/service/canadian-immigration-services/intra-company-transfer-ict/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Discover the Intra Company Transfer (ICT) to Canada, a special program for moving skilled employees between global offices. Get clear info on the basics, eligibility, company duties, necessary paperwork, processing times, and costs. Skip the LMIA with this easy-to-get work permit.\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/canadian-immigration-services/intra-company-transfer-ict/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Intra Company Transfer (ICT) - Lalani & Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Discover the Intra Company Transfer (ICT) to Canada, a special program for moving skilled employees between global offices. Get clear info on the basics, eligibility, company duties, necessary paperwork, processing times, and costs. Skip the LMIA with this easy-to-get work permit.\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/canadian-immigration-services/intra-company-transfer-ict/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-06-07T12:19:14+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725342861_1719813365_Intra-Company.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1342\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"896\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"3 minutes\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<h4 id=\"1-general-overview\" class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">1.&nbsp;<strong>General Overview</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p>The intra-company category permits international companies to temporarily transfer qualified employees to Canada for the purpose of improving management effectiveness, expanding Canadian exports, and enhancing competitiveness in overseas markets.</p>\r\n<p>If an international company has a location within Canada that company can apply to have any of their employees transferred to the Canada location. Applying for an Intra-Company Transfer visa allows the company and employee to avoid applying for an&nbsp;LMIA&nbsp;since this is an LMIA-exempt work permit. Qualified intra-company transferees require work permits and are exempted from the Labor Market Impact Assessment (LMIA).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h4 id=\"2-eligibility-requirements-for-applicants\" class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>2. General Requirements</strong></span></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>You are currently employed by an international company and seeking entry to Canada in a parent, subsidiary, branch, or an affiliate of that company.</li>\r\n<li>You are transferring to a company that has a qualifying relationship (see below) and will be undertaking employment at a legitimate and continuing establishment of that company</li>\r\n<li>You are being transferred to a position in an executive, senior managerial, or specialized knowledge capacity.</li>\r\n<li>You have been employed continuously (proved through payroll or other form) by the company that plans to transfer them outside Canada in a similar full-time position for at least one year in the three-year period immediately preceding the date of initial application.</li>\r\n<li>You are coming to Canada for a temporary period only.</li>\r\n<li>You comply with all the immigration requirements for temporary entry</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h4 id=\"3-start-up-applicaiton-process\" class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>3. Company Requirements</strong></span></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Generally, the company must secure physical premises to house the Canadian operation, particularly in the case of specialized knowledge. However, in specific cases involving senior managers or executives, it would be acceptable that the address of the new start-up not yet be secured; for example, the company may use its counsel&rsquo;s address until the executive can purchase or lease a premise.</li>\r\n<li>The company must furnish realistic plans to staff the new operation.</li>\r\n<li>The company must have the financial ability to commence business in Canada and compensate employees.</li>\r\n<li>When transferring executives or managers, the company must\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>demonstrate that it will be large enough to support executive or management function.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>When transferring a specialized knowledge worker, the company must\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>demonstrate that it is expected to be doing business;</li>\r\n<li>ensure that work is guided and directed by management at the Canadian operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h4 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>4. Required Documents</strong></span></h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>confirmation that the foreign national is currently employed by a multi-national enterprise outside Canada, and seeking entry to work in a parent, subsidiary, branch, or affiliate of that enterprise in Canada.</li>\r\n<li>confirmation that the foreign national has been employed (via payroll or by contract) continuously (full-time, not accumulated part-time) by the enterprise outside Canada, in a similar full-time position, for at least one year within the three-year period immediately preceding the date of initial application;</li>\r\n<li>outline of the applicant&rsquo;s position in an executive or managerial capacity or one involving specialized knowledge (i.e. position, title, place in the organization, job description);</li>\r\n<li>in the case of &ldquo;specialized knowledge&rdquo;, evidence that the person has such knowledge and that the position in Canada requires such knowledge;</li>\r\n<li>outline of the position in Canada (namely, position, title, place in the organization, job description);</li>\r\n<li>indication of intended duration of stay; and</li>\r\n<li>description of the relationship between the enterprise in Canada and the enterprise in the foreign country (the officer may request tangible proof to establish the relationship between the Canadian and foreign organization wishing to make the transfer).</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<h4 id=\"4-processing-time\" class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>5. Processing Time</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p>The average time for the Intra-Company Transfer (ICT) is 2 to 10 weeks but there are priority processing options. Those who are qualified for the 2-week processing time will get the Intra-Company Transfer visa within 2 weeks. This priority processing option is for visa-exempt countries (biometrics processing is not included in these 2 weeks).</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<h4 id=\"5-legal-and-professional-fee\" class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">6.&nbsp;<strong>Legal and professional fee</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p>The legal and professional fee for Intra Company Transfer is USD 45,000.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725342861_1719813365_Intra-Company.webp', 'Canada Intra Company Transfer (ICT) Program', 'uploads/1725429102_1722681687_Start-up-Visa-Program.webp', 'Canada Intra Company Transfer (ICT)', 'Canada', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 05:56:05', '2024-09-04 07:04:26');
INSERT INTO `program` (`id`, `title`, `url_link`, `metadata`, `program_detail`, `Image`, `image_alt`, `deatil_image`, `detail_image_alt`, `country`, `program_form`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(13, 'Provincial Nominee Program Business\r\n', '/service/canadian-immigration-services/provincial-nominee-program/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Discover Canada\'s Provincial Nominee Program Business (PNP) for family immigration opportunities. Unlock endless chances in a welcoming land.\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/canadian-immigration-services/provincial-nominee-program/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Provincial Nominee Program Business - Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Discover Canada\'s Provincial Nominee Program Business (PNP) for family immigration opportunities. Unlock endless chances in a welcoming land.\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/canadian-immigration-services/provincial-nominee-program/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-08-15T11:21:43+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725342880_1719813462_Canada-Image-02.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1343\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"896\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"12 minutes\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<h3 id=\"entrepreneur-programs-for-canada\" class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Entrepreneur Programs for Canada</strong></span></h3>\r\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<cite>Canada, being the land of endless opportunities for people from different backgrounds, offers numerous chances for individuals to immigrate with their families. Taking your business to Canada is just one of those opportunities. If you have a business idea that you believe can achieve great success in the country, the<a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/jobs/opportunities/government.html\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/jobs/opportunities/government.html\">Canadian government</a> warmly welcomes you. The government is constantly seeking effective ways to enhance economic conditions, including employment rates, and therefore encourages foreign entrepreneurs to establish and settle their businesses in Canada. However, there are several eligibility conditions that an applicant must meet to obtain an Entrepreneurial visa for Canada. The management and control of business programs, which directly or indirectly lead to immigration status, are handled by each Canadian province.<br><br></cite></blockquote>\r\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><cite><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\"><br><br></cite></blockquote>\r\n<p>Specific Canadian provinces have designed the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/provincial-nominees/works.html\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/provincial-nominees/works.html\"><strong>Provincial Nominee Program</strong></a>&nbsp;Business, commonly known as&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/provincial-nominees/works.html\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/provincial-nominees/works.html\"><strong>Provincial Nominee Program</strong></a>&nbsp;Business, with the intention of attracting foreign entrepreneurs and business owners. This program is a crucial component of Canada&rsquo;s Immigration Plan, which seeks to foster economic growth in the country by welcoming individuals with a demonstrated track record of success in business ownership and investment.<br><br>Through the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/provincial-nominees/works.html\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/provincial-nominees/works.html\"><strong>Provincial Nominee Program</strong></a>&nbsp;Business, applicants can apply for permanent residency in Canada by first submitting an Expression of Interest (EOI) to the province they wish to settle. The EOI is a preliminary application that outlines the applicant&rsquo;s business proposal and their intention to invest in the province&rsquo;s economy. After the EOI is submitted, the application will undergo a review by the province, and upon approval, the applicant will be passively issued an Invitation to Apply (ITA) for permanent residency<br><br>The benefits of the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/provincial-nominees/works.html\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/provincial-nominees/works.html\"><strong>Provincial Nominee Program</strong></a>&nbsp;Business for both the applicant and the province are numerous. For the applicant, it provides a pathway to permanent residency in Canada and the ability to start or expand a business in one of Canada&rsquo;s thriving provinces. For the province, it brings in skilled entrepreneurs and business owners who can create jobs and stimulate the local economy.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<h3 id=\"manitoba-provincial-nominee-program-for-business-mpnp-b\" class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Manitoba Provincial Nominee Program For Business (MPNP-B)</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p>The Manitoba&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/provincial-nominees/works.html\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/provincial-nominees/works.html\"><strong>Provincial Nominee Program</strong></a>&nbsp;caters specifically to businessmen and senior executives with the intention of settling in the Canadian province of Manitoba. This program passively issues a Temporary Work Permit (TWP) visa, which maintains a validity of two years. Compliance with the Business Performance Agreement with the Government of Manitoba leads to obtaining permanent residency status.<br><br><strong>Eligibility Requirements:</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Minimum Net worth should be CAD 500,000</li>\r\n<li>Must have at least 3 years in the last 5 years of business ownership and active management experience in a successful business having at least 33.33% ownership share therein OR at least 3 years in last 5 years of Executive-Level experience as senior manager of a successful business having none or less than 33.33% ownership share therein</li>\r\n<li>At least high school or equivalent level of education</li>\r\n<li>Must give language test with minimum score of CLB 5 or equivalent</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Other requirement:</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>While internet-based research may be a useful tool to obtain preliminary and general information, an in-person exploratory visit is essential for applicant to conduct in-depth business research, which is critical to his/ her business plan and future success in Manitoba</li>\r\n<li>A proposal of minimum investment of at least CAD 250,000 if a business is situated in the Winnipeg Metropolitan Region or CAD 150,000 if a business is situated outside of the Winnipeg Metropolitan Region.</li>\r\n<li>Selection of applicant is based on points calculated on various factors including applicant&rsquo;s age, his/ her business ownership and/ or past management experience, net-worth position, language test results and proposed investment level</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Eligible Family Members</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Principal Applicant</li>\r\n<li>Spouse</li>\r\n<li>Children below the age of 22 years</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Citizenship Requirements</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Permanent residents are required to physically present in Canada for at least 1,095 days in the last 5 years</li>\r\n<li>Adults are also required to write a citizenship test and provide proof of adequate English or French ability</li>\r\n<li>Children under 18 are usually granted citizenship upon one of their parents becoming a citizen</li>\r\n<li>Children over 18 must fulfill citizenship requirements</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<h3 id=\"ontario-immigration-nominee-program-oinp\" class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Ontario Immigration Nominee Program (OINP)</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p>The Entrepreneur Stream of the Ontario Immigrant Nominee Program passively aims to attract and provide support to entrepreneurs and high-net-worth individuals, enabling them to establish new businesses in Canada or purchase existing businesses in the province of Ontario. Work Permit status is initially granted through the entrepreneur streams, which can later be converted into Permanent Residency status upon the fulfillment of the conditions stated in the Performance Agreement and the submission of the final report after 18 months of business establishment.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><strong>Eligibility Conditions:</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Must have either 2 years of active management in business with ownership at least 33.33% share within last 5 years OR 2 years of senior management experience within last 5 years from the date of application submission</li>\r\n<li>For net worth requirement for this program, there are two options available for Applicant, i.e. either,<br><br>a) With net worth of at least CAD 800,000 for investment proposal within Greater Toronto Area (GTA) or<br>b) A net worth of at least CAD 400,000 for investment proposal outside GTA<br><br>However, should the proposed business investment is related to Information and Communication Technology (ICT)/ Digital Communication (DC) sector, a CAD 400,000 of net worth availability may allow an applicant to invest inside GTA</li>\r\n<li>In case, applicant intends to purchase an existing business in Ontario, he/ she must make a visit to Ontario</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Additional Factors:</strong></p>\r\n<p>With following additional factors, applicant will have an advantage in selection of his/her application;</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Post-Secondary or higher diploma/degree</li>\r\n<li>English language test with score of at least CLB 5 or equivalent</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Investment Requirement:</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>A minimum investment proposal of at least CAD 600,000 is passively required in the GTA, while $200,000 is passively required outside the GTA. However, should the proposed business investment is related to the Information and Communication Technology (ICT)/ Digital Communication (DC) sector, an investment of at least CAD 200,000 may allow an applicant to invest in GTA</li>\r\n<li>The proposed business plan must demonstrate ability to create two jobs for business established in GTA or one job for business located outside GTA</li>\r\n<li>Selection of applicant is based on points calculated on various factors including applicant&rsquo;s age, his/ her business ownership and/ or past management experience, net-worth position, language test results and proposed investment level</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Eligible Family Members</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Principal Applicant</li>\r\n<li>Spouse</li>\r\n<li>Children below the age of 22 years</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Citizenship Requirements</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Passively, permanent residents have an obligation to ensure that they have been physically present in Canada for a minimum of 1,095 days within the last 5 years.</li>\r\n<li>Passively, adults must write a citizenship test and provide proof of adequate ability in English or French.</li>\r\n<li>Citizenship is usually passively granted to children under 18 when one of their parents passively becomes a citizen.</li>\r\n<li>Children over 18 must fulfill citizenship requirements</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<h3 id=\"saskatchewan-entrepreneur-application-sinp\" class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Saskatchewan Entrepreneur Application &ndash; SINP</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p>The Saskatchewan Immigrant Nominee Program (SINP) for experienced entrepreneurs can provide an alternate means of entry into Canada. A Temporary Work Permit (TWP) is passively issued as the visa, which remains valid for two years. TWP may lead to permanent residency status upon complying with the&nbsp;<em>Business Performance Agreement (BPA)</em>&nbsp;executed with the Government of Saskatchewan.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><strong>Eligibility Requirements:</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Minimum Net worth should be CAD 500,000</li>\r\n<li>Must have at least 3 years in the last 10 years of Business management or entrepreneurial experience in a business ownership share therein</li>\r\n<li>A proposal of minimum investment of at least CAD 300,000 in the Regina or Saskatoon or $200,000 in any other community must be made</li>\r\n<li>The proposed business must create 2 new jobs if proposed business is in the Regina or Saskatoon. However, there is no job creation requirement in other communities of that province.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Other requirement:</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>The possession of a one-year trade certification or a graduate degree will passively provide an added benefit.</li>\r\n<li>Can provide language test with minimum score of CLB 4 or equivalent will give additional points</li>\r\n<li>An exploratory visit by applicant to the province can be critical in selection factors by SINP</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Eligible Family Members</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Principal Applicant</li>\r\n<li>Spouse</li>\r\n<li>Children below the age of 22 years</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Citizenship Requirements</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Permanent residents passively have an obligation to ensure that they have been physically present in Canada for a minimum of 1,095 days within the last 5 years.</li>\r\n<li>The requirement for adults passively includes writing a citizenship test and providing proof of adequate English ability.</li>\r\n<li>Children under 18 typically passively receive citizenship when one of their parents passively becomes a citizen.</li>\r\n<li>Children over 18 must passively fulfill citizenship requirements.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<h3 id=\"british-columbia-provincial-nominee-program-bc-bnp\" class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>British Columbia Provincial Nominee Program (BC-BNP)</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p>The British Columbia&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/provincial-nominees/works.html\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/provincial-nominees/works.html\"><strong>Provincial Nominee Program</strong></a>&nbsp;(BC-PNP) passively caters to business owners and senior managers who intend to passively invest funds into a proposed business in British Columbia and obtain a work permit for Canada.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><strong>Eligibility and Other Requirements:</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>The applicant must have a net worth of at least CDN $ 600,000 for Base Category while for Regional Category, minimum net worth requirement is of CAD 300,000. (Note: Net worth cannot include assets received as inheritance)</li>\r\n<li>Applicant must have experience of 3+ years as a business owner-manager, OR 4+ years of experience as a senior manager OR a combination of 1+ year experience as a business owner-manager and 2+ years of experience as a senior manager in last 10 years</li>\r\n<li>An exploratory trip to the province is optional under Base category while it is compulsory under Regional category for personal research of business options and meeting with the community</li>\r\n<li>Must give language test with minimum score of CLB 4 or equivalent</li>\r\n<li>Applicant must have two years of post-secondary education, or else, have experience as an active business owner-manager for at least 3 years (of the last 5 years) with 100% ownership in the business</li>\r\n<li>Proposed investment in BC must be new establishment (at least 51% share) under Regional Category with at least CDN $ 100,000 while under Base category, it can either be new or existing establishment (at least 33.3% share) with at least CAD 200,000</li>\r\n<li>Applicant must demonstrate the ability to create at least one job in a proposed business</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Eligible Family Members</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Principal Applicant</li>\r\n<li>Spouse</li>\r\n<li>Children below the age of 22 years</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Citizenship Requirements</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Permanent resident are required to physically present in Canada for at least 1,095 days in the last 5 years</li>\r\n<li>Adults are also required to write a citizenship test and provide proof of adequate English ability</li>\r\n<li>Children under 18 are usually granted citizenship upon one of their parents becoming a citizen</li>\r\n<li>Children over 18 must fulfill citizenship requirements</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<h3 id=\"prince-edward-island-provincial-nominee-program-pei-pnp-work-permit-stream\" class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Prince Edward Island Provincial Nominee Program (PEI &ndash; PNP) &ndash; Work Permit Stream</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Eligibility Conditions:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Applicant&rsquo;s age must be between 21 and 59 years</li>\r\n<li>Must have either 3 years of active management in business with ownership at least 20% share with in last 5 years OR 3 years of senior management experience within last 5 years from the date of application submission</li>\r\n<li>Net worth should be CAD 600,000 (NOTE: only 30% of total equity value can be counted while no gifts are allowed in net worth determination</li>\r\n<li>Must possess a minimum education of secondary school equivalent</li>\r\n<li>English language test with score of at least CLB 4 or equivalent</li>\r\n<li>Intend to live and work in PEI while providing day to day management of proposed business there</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Selection Factors for success:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>A proposal of minimum investment of at least CAD 150,000</li>\r\n<li>English language test of spouse or dependent children with score of at least CLB 5 or equivalent</li>\r\n<li>An in-person visit to the province is optional. However, it will help applicant to gain knowledge about the Province and its business environment. Moreover, Community Endorsement letter frm the PEI community will give applicant additional points</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Eligible Family Members</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Principal Applicant</li>\r\n<li>Spouse</li>\r\n<li>Children below the age of 22 years</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><strong>Citizenship Requirements</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Permanent resident are required to physically present in Canada for at least 1,095 days in the last 5 years</li>\r\n<li>Adults are also required to write a citizenship test and provide proof of adequate English ability</li>\r\n<li>Children under 18 are usually granted citizenship upon one of their parents becoming a citizen</li>\r\n<li>Children over 18 must fulfill citizenship requirements</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<h3 id=\"new-brunswick-provincial-nominee-program-nbpnp\" class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>New Brunswick Provincial Nominee Program (NBPNP)</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p>Located on the east coast of Canada, New Brunswick (NB) is a province that lies beside the State of Maine and under Quebec&rsquo;s Gaspe Peninsula. It is officially the only bilingual province, with approximately 30% of people speaking French as their native language.</p>\r\n<p><br>The New Brunswick&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/provincial-nominees/works.html\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/provincial-nominees/works.html\"><strong>Provincial Nominee Program</strong></a>&nbsp;(NB-PNP) allows applicant and its family to get work permit initially. This work permit will lead to the Permanent Residency status upon compliance of conditions of the Performance Agreement. This program is accepting EOIs (Expression of Interests) from candidates who can meet the eligibility criteria as established by New Brunswick (NB) Government under this program.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Eligibility Requirements:</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Applicant&rsquo;s age must be between 22 and 55 years</li>\r\n<li>An exploratory trip to the province before submitting an EOI is optional however will gives extra points to the applicant.</li>\r\n<li>Intend to invest at least CAD 250,000 in order to establish or purchase a business</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Net worth should be CAD 600,000 (must be liquid and unencumbered). However, inherited and gifted assets are not included which are received within 6 months prior to the application submission date</li>\r\n<li>Language test for principal applicant and that of its spouse will be added benefit</li>\r\n<li>Applicant with high school diploma/ certificate is eligible to apply</li>\r\n<li>Owns and manage a business (at least 51% share) for at least three years out of the last five years from submission of an EOI OR at least 3 out of last 5 years of experience as a senior business manager</li>\r\n<li>Intends to reside permanently in New Brunswick while owning and personally managing a business which must be based in New Brunswick</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Additional Information:</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>The program is the Wok Permit stream</li>\r\n<li>New or existing business can be proposed in the application with at least 33.33% share</li>\r\n<li>Proposed business must intends to create at least one full time job, excluding spouse/ children</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Eligible Family Members</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Principal Applicant</li>\r\n<li>Spouse</li>\r\n<li>Children below the age of 22 years</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Citizenship Requirements</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Passively, permanent residents have an obligation to ensure that they have been physically present in Canada for a minimum of 1,095 days within the last 5 years.</li>\r\n<li>Passively, adults must write a citizenship test and provide proof of adequate English ability.</li>\r\n<li>Passively, citizenship is usually granted to children under 18 when one of their parents becomes a citizen.</li>\r\n<li>Citizenship requirements must be passively fulfilled by children over 18.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>A higher standard of living, world-class education with reduced tuition fees, as low as one-fourth of the fees for Permanent Residents of Canada in public schools, and advanced health-care facilities covering social insurance plans will be passively provided to the applicants and their families.</p>\r\n<p><br><br>New Brunswick is also an attractive destination for its sandy beaches, magnificent rivers, lush forests, and adventurous parks<br><br><em>For more details please&nbsp;<a href=\"../contact/\">contact our senior immigration consultants and advisors.</a></em></p>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\"><br>\r\n<h2><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Table of Contents</strong></span></h2>\r\n<nav>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li class=\"\"><a href=\"../service/canadian-immigration-services/provincial-nominee-program/#entrepreneur-programs-for-canada\">Entrepreneur Programs for Canada</a></li>\r\n<li class=\"\"><a href=\"../service/canadian-immigration-services/provincial-nominee-program/#manitoba-provincial-nominee-program-for-business-mpnp-b\">Manitoba Provincial Nominee Program For Business (MPNP-B)</a></li>\r\n<li class=\"\"><a href=\"../service/canadian-immigration-services/provincial-nominee-program/#ontario-immigration-nominee-program-oinp\">Ontario Immigration Nominee Program (OINP)</a></li>\r\n<li class=\"\"><a href=\"../service/canadian-immigration-services/provincial-nominee-program/#saskatchewan-entrepreneur-application-sinp\">Saskatchewan Entrepreneur Application &ndash; SINP</a></li>\r\n<li class=\"\"><a href=\"../service/canadian-immigration-services/provincial-nominee-program/#british-columbia-provincial-nominee-program-bc-bnp\">British Columbia Provincial Nominee Program (BC-BNP)</a></li>\r\n<li class=\"\"><a href=\"../service/canadian-immigration-services/provincial-nominee-program/#prince-edward-island-provincial-nominee-program-pei-pnp-work-permit-stream\">Prince Edward Island Provincial Nominee Program (PEI &ndash; PNP) &ndash; Work Permit Stream</a></li>\r\n<li class=\"\"><a href=\"../service/canadian-immigration-services/provincial-nominee-program/#new-brunswick-provincial-nominee-program-nbpnp\">New Brunswick Provincial Nominee Program (NBPNP)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</nav></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725342880_1719813462_Canada-Image-02.webp', 'Canada Provincial Nominee Program Business ', 'uploads/1725428990_canada1.webp', 'Canada Provincial Nominee Program Business (PNP)', 'Canada', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 05:57:42', '2024-09-04 07:04:57');
INSERT INTO `program` (`id`, `title`, `url_link`, `metadata`, `program_detail`, `Image`, `image_alt`, `deatil_image`, `detail_image_alt`, `country`, `program_form`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(14, 'Provincial Nominee Program Express Entry\r\n', '/service/canadian-immigration-services/pnp-express-entry/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Explore PNP Express Entry and Express Entry programs for streamlined immigration to Canada, fostering regional growth\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/canadian-immigration-services/pnp-express-entry/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"PNP Express Entry - Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Explore PNP Express Entry and Express Entry programs for streamlined immigration to Canada, fostering regional growth\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/canadian-immigration-services/pnp-express-entry/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-04-18T05:53:36+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725342897_1719813604_Canada-Image-03.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1342\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"896\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"4 minutes\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<h2 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>PNP Express Entry</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Introduction:</strong></span></h2>\r\nPNP Express Entry are two prominent immigration pathways in Canada. PNP Express Entry enables provinces and territories to nominate skilled individuals for local economic contributions. Express Entry, on the other hand, is a federal immigration system that manages the applications of skilled workers. Combining these programs, Canada selects and welcomes skilled individuals who meet regional needs, fostering nationwide economic growth and development<br><br>.<img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\"><br><br><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Express Entry</strong></span>\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<p>PNP Express Entry is the skilled worker program factoring age, education, experience, etc. to rank your profile in the pool. First, check your eligibility for <a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/provincial-nominees/express-entry/eligibility.html\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/provincial-nominees/application-process/express-entry.html\">Express Entry Program</a>&nbsp;streams: Federal Skilled Worker, Federal Skilled Trades, and Canadian Experience Class. Express Entry is Canada&rsquo;s application management system introduced by IRCC for efficient immigration processing. IRCC invites applicants periodically to apply for permanent residency. Upon approval of permanent residency application, they along with their families can live and work freely anywhere in Canada.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Provincial Nominee Programs</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p>The PNP Express Entry enables provinces and territories to nominate individuals for immigration and settlement in specific regions of Canada. The program has evolved over the years with various changes.</p>\r\n<p>The PNP Express Entry selects skilled candidates from the Express Entry pool to meet regional labor market needs. PNP nominees receive 600 extra CRS points, greatly enhancing their chances of receiving an ITA for permanent residency.</p>\r\n<p>To qualify for the PNP, candidates create an Express Entry profile and meet eligibility criteria for federal economic immigration programs. After entering the pool, they can submit an Expression of Interest (EOI) to a desired province or territory. If selected, they may be nominated for permanent residency.</p>\r\n<p>Each province and territory has unique eligibility requirements and selection criteria for the PNP. Candidates should consult the websites of the provinces and territories to find out more information about their specific programs.</p>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<h3 id=\"pnp\" class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>SASKATCHEWAN IMMIGRANT NOMINEE PROGRAM (SINP)</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p>The SINP (Saskatchewan Immigrant Nominee Program) is a pathway for skilled and experienced candidates to apply for Canadian Permanent Residency. With a population of over one million, Saskatchewan is known as the &ldquo;Land of the Living Skies,&rdquo; showcasing vast horizons and frequent Northern lights. It offers an affordable high standard of living, an excellent educational system, and a rich culture</p>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<h3 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>ONTARIO IMMIGRATION NOMINEE PROGRAM (OINP)</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p>Ontario is the most popular destination of Canada for newcomers. It covers the second most land area in Canada. Toronto is the capital city of Ontario that has a population of about six million people. Nearly half of the people living in Toronto are foreign nationals who made it the most multicultural city in the globe.<br><br>International applicants who possess the required skills, education and in demand experience qualify for this program, who can contribute to the development of Ontario&rsquo;s economy.</p>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<h3 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>MANITOBA IMMIGRATION NOMINEE PROGRAM</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p>Manitoba, the backbone of Canada&rsquo;s economy, is known for its agriculture and natural resources. The province of Manitoba is also famous as the &ldquo;Gateway to Western Canada&rdquo;, which is situated in the middle of Canada. It is an accessible and welcoming region for the newcomers. It is home to natural beauty with a safe and friendly environment, which also has a low cost of living and many career opportunities for individuals in the region.<br><br>The province of Manitoba sends an invitation to the eligible applicants who best suit the changing labor market needs and have ties to the province.</p>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<h3 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>ALBERTA PROVINCIAL NOMINEE PROGRAM (AINP)</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p>Alberta is leading oil and gas industries all over the world with industrial and service economy of Alberta is growing fast. It is argued to be the most prosperous province of Canada that attracts many immigrants all across the globe.<br><br>Alberta Immigrant Nominee Program enables the province to select a finite number of eligible candidates from Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada (IRCC) Express Entry system. Candidates who have shown strong ties with Alberta or who can support economic development and diversification priorities of Alberta may be invited or selected to apply for the program.</p>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<h3 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>QUEBEC SKILLED WORKER</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p>Quebec is a predominantly French-speaking province in eastern Canada with 2 vibrant cities in its south Montreal and Quebec City. It dominates the trade, finance and transportation industry. Quebec offers excellent quality of life in terms of housing, healthcare, education and environment.<br><br></p>\r\n<p>The Quebec Immigration selection system for an Independent Quebec Skilled Worker aims to identify prospective applicants who can economically establish themselves in Quebec based on their education, experience, and language proficiency. Moreover, there are several pivotal supplementary factors that can substantially improve the chances of receiving an invitation. These factors include having close ties to Quebec through past experience, possessing educational credentials obtained from Quebec, or having close relatives residing in the province.</p>\r\n<p><br><em>For more details please&nbsp;<a href=\"../contact/\">contact our senior immigration consultants and advisors.</a></em></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725342897_1719813604_Canada-Image-03.webp', 'Canada Provincial Nominee Program Express Entry Program', 'uploads/1725428856_canada2.webp', 'Canada Provincial Nominee Program Express Entry', 'Canada', 'detail_form', '2024-07-01 06:00:04', '2025-01-25 07:43:21');
INSERT INTO `program` (`id`, `title`, `url_link`, `metadata`, `program_detail`, `Image`, `image_alt`, `deatil_image`, `detail_image_alt`, `country`, `program_form`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(15, 'Sponsor your parents and grandparents\r\n', '/service/canadian-immigration-services/sponsor-your-parents-and-grandparents/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Sponsor your parents and grandparents to live in Canada. Explore eligibility, requirements, and application process for family reunification.\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/canadian-immigration-services/sponsor-your-parents-and-grandparents/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Sponsor your parents and grandparents - Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Sponsor your parents and grandparents to live in Canada. Explore eligibility, requirements, and application process for family reunification.\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/canadian-immigration-services/sponsor-your-parents-and-grandparents/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-04-18T05:57:57+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725342914_1719813671_Canada-Image-06.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1343\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"897\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"3 minutes\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<p>Sponsor your parents and grandparents to live in Canada with our comprehensive guide. Learn about eligibility, requirements, and the application process for family reunification.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<h4 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">Introduction Sponsor your parents and grandparents:</span></h4>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/family-sponsorship/sponsor-parents-grandparents.html\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/family-sponsorship/sponsor-parents-grandparents.html\">Sponsor your parents and grandparent</a>s, bringing joy and comfort to your family. As a Canadian citizen or permanent resident, you can potentially sponsor them for permanent residency in Canada.</p>\r\n<p>The Family Class Sponsorship program reunites Canadian citizens and permanent residents with family members living abroad. This includes parents and grandparents who can benefit from the care and support of their loved ones in Canada.</p>\r\n<p>To sponsor your parents and grandparents, you must meet government eligibility requirements:</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>1. You must be 18 years of age or older.<br>2. You must be a Canadian citizen or permanent resident.<br>3. You must meet the minimum income requirements to support your sponsored relative(s) and their dependents.<br>4. You must commit to providing financial support for your sponsored relative(s) and dependents for 3-10 years.<br><br></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\"><br><br>Once you meet the eligibility requirements, you can submit a sponsorship application on behalf of your parents or grandparents to Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada (IRCC). You will need to provide supporting documents, such as your birth certificate, proof of your Canadian citizenship or permanent residency, and proof of your relationship with your sponsored relative(s).<br><br>The sponsorship process can take several months or more to complete, depending on the volume of applications received by IRCC. It is important to prepare your application carefully and thoroughly, and to follow up with IRCC to ensure that your application is being processed.<br><br>If your sponsorship application is approved, your parent(s) or grandparent(s) will be issued a visa to come to Canada as permanent residents. They will have access to government-funded health care, education, and social services, just like any other Canadian resident.<br><br></p>\r\n<p>Sponsor your parents and grandparents can have many benefits for your family. You will be able to provide emotional and practical support to your loved ones, and they will have the opportunity to experience Canadian culture and lifestyle. You will also benefit from their knowledge, experience, and wisdom, which can enrich your family and community.<br><br>At the same time, Sponsor your parents and grandparents can also be a significant financial and emotional commitment. You will need to provide for their basic needs, such as housing, food, clothing, and transportation, as well as their medical and other expenses. You will also need to help them adjust to Canadian society and language, and provide social and cultural support to avoid isolation and loneliness.<br><br><br><em>For more details please&nbsp;<a href=\"../contact/\">contact our senior immigration consultants and advisors.</a></em></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725342914_1719813671_Canada-Image-06.webp', 'Canada Parents Sponsorship Program', 'uploads/1725428798_Sponsor-your-parents-and-grandparents-1.webp', 'Canada Sponsor your parents and grandparents', 'Canada', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 06:01:11', '2024-09-04 07:06:12');
INSERT INTO `program` (`id`, `title`, `url_link`, `metadata`, `program_detail`, `Image`, `image_alt`, `deatil_image`, `detail_image_alt`, `country`, `program_form`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(16, 'USA EB-5 Investor Program\r\n', '/service/united-states/usa-eb-5-investor-program/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Unlock US residency via investment with the USA EB-5 Investor Program. The top immigration consultants in Pakistan.\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/united-states/usa-eb-5-investor-program/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"USA EB-5 Investor Program - Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Unlock US residency via investment with the USA EB-5 Investor Program. The top immigration consultants in Pakistan.\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/united-states/usa-eb-5-investor-program/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-04-20T04:23:43+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725342931_1719814130_USA-Image-02.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1343\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"896\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"3 minutes\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<h2 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>USA EB-5 Investor Program</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p>The USA&nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EB-5_visa\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EB-5_visa\">EB-5</a>&nbsp;Investor Program is an investment-based program that allows foreign nationals to obtain a green card through investment. Under the program, foreign nationals can invest around $1 million, in a targeted employment area, in a new commercial enterprise in the United States in exchange for a green card.<br><br>One of the major benefits of the USA EB-5 Investor Program is that it provides a fast track to permanent residency in the United States. Foreign nationals who invest in the program can obtain a conditional green card within 18-24 months, and then apply for permanent residency after two years. The program also allows investors to bring their immediate family members with them, including spouses and unmarried children under the age of 21.<br><br>The USA EB-5 Investor Program has also been beneficial for the US economy. The investments made by foreign nationals have created thousands of new jobs and stimulated economic growth in regional centers across the country. Regional centers are government-approved entities that promote economic growth in specific geographical areas.<br><br>US government has made several changes to the program in recent years. In 2019, the minimum investment amount was raised from $500,000 to $900,000 in targeted employment areas, and from $1 million to $1.8 million in non-targeted areas. The changes were made to ensure that the program is still benefiting the US economy and creating jobs in high-unemployment areas.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Lalani &amp; Associates has vetted several projects in the hospitality industry for its clients which it recommends for the USA EB-5 Investor Program.<br><br></p>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\"><br><br></div>\r\n<h3 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>USA EB-5</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Investor Requirement:</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>US $800,000 for TEA investors and USD 1.05 million for non-TEA investors (Financing option is not allowed)</li>\r\n<li>Investment must be made from legal source of applicant&rsquo;s funds and evidence of legal money trail</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<h3 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Benefits:</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Upon landing in the US, after the visa approval, investors and their families enjoy almost the same benefits as are available to other US residents or Citizens</li>\r\n<li>International visa-free travel mobility after becoming US citizen</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<h3 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Other Requirement:</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>No minimum Net worth requirement for the investor. Hence no need to disclose other assets</li>\r\n<li>To maintain Permanent Residency, applicant should intend to settle permanently in the US</li>\r\n<li>Investor applicant is eligible to apply for US citizenship after 5 years if he/ she physically resided in the US for at least 2.5 years out of 5 years with at least 6 months presence in each of those 5 years</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<h3 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Eligible Family Members:</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Spouse</li>\r\n<li>Children below the age of 21 years</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><em>For more details please&nbsp;<a href=\"../contact/\">contact our senior immigration consultants and advisors.</a></em></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725342931_1719814130_USA-Image-02.webp', 'USA EB-5 Investor Program', 'uploads/1725428733_USA-EB-5-Investor-Program-Main-Back-Banner.webp', 'USA EB-5 Investor', 'USA', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 06:08:50', '2024-09-04 07:07:05');
INSERT INTO `program` (`id`, `title`, `url_link`, `metadata`, `program_detail`, `Image`, `image_alt`, `deatil_image`, `detail_image_alt`, `country`, `program_form`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(17, 'USA EB-3 - Immigration Visa for Skilled Workers\r\n', '/service/united-states/usa-eb-3-immigration-visa-for-skilled-workers/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Gain permanent residency in the USA with the USA EB-3 Immigration Visa for Skilled Workers. Get expert assistance from Lalani & Associates.\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/united-states/usa-eb-3-immigration-visa-for-skilled-workers/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"USA EB-3 Immigration Visa for Skilled Workers\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Gain permanent residency in the USA with the USA EB-3 Immigration Visa for Skilled Workers. Get expert assistance from Lalani & Associates.\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/united-states/usa-eb-3-immigration-visa-for-skilled-workers/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-04-20T04:33:25+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725342949_1719814211_USA-Image-03.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1342\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"896\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"3 minutes\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<h2 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>USA EB-3 Immigration Skilled Workers Program</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p>The USA EB-3 Immigration Visa for Skilled Workers is designed to help foreign nationals with certain occupational skills and backgrounds to gain permanent resident status in the United States. EB-3 stands for &ldquo;employment-based third preference,&rdquo; which means that the program prioritizes applicants who have a job offer in the United States and who possess skills that are in high demand but are not considered &ldquo;exceptional.&rdquo;<br><br>The USA EB-3 program is broken down into three categories:<br><br><strong>Skilled Workers:</strong>&nbsp;This category is for individuals who have at least two years of experience in a skilled occupation and who have been offered a permanent job in the United States that requires those skills.<br><br><strong>Professionals:</strong>&nbsp;This category is for individuals with bachelor&rsquo;s degrees and who have been offered a permanent job in the United States that requires a degree.<br><br><strong>Other Workers:</strong>&nbsp;This category is for individuals who are doing unskilled labor, have less than two years of experience, and have been offered a permanent job in the United States that requires that labor.<br><br>The USA EB-3 program is similar to the other employment-based immigration programs in that it requires the employer to sponsor the applicant. The employer must file a Labor Certification with the Department of Labor, which verifies that there are no qualified U.S. workers available to fill the position. Once the certification has been approved, the employer can file an Immigrant Petition for Alien Worker, which is the form used to request permanent resident status for the applicant.<br><br>While the USA EB-3 program has certain requirements, it is generally considered to be more accessible than other employment-based immigration programs. This is because it does not require applicants to have &ldquo;exceptional&rdquo; skills, as the EB-1 and EB-2 programs do. Additionally, there is no minimum investment required like there is for the EB-5 program.<br><br>The EB-3 program is popular among immigrants who work in healthcare, education, and skilled trades such as electricians, plumbers, and mechanics. These occupations are in high demand in the United States and often have a shortage of qualified workers.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>USA EB-3 Visa is a preference category for&nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States\">United States</a>&nbsp;employment-based green card/permanent residency. Semi-skilled workers or other professionals qualify for this type of the USA work visa.<br><br><br><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\"><br><br>The eligibility is judged through education, skills, and work experience:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>For semi-skilled workers, at least 6 months of experience or training is acceptable but must be able to prove that they are capable of performing the job in question.</li>\r\n<li>Lalani &amp; Associates provides job offers in this category.</li>\r\n<li>Examples of employment includes, but are not limited to, nurses, caregivers, fast food counter attendants, window cleaners, cleaners/janitors.</li>\r\n<li>Nursing and caregiving jobs require a diploma or bachelor&rsquo;s degree in nursing (BSN), whereas other jobs require an intermediate or matriculation education. In both cases, Basic English skills are required.</li>\r\n<li>A full-time permanent employment and labor certification is also required. The nature of their work/job should be such that there are no other qualified people already present in the USA performing such a job.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\">\r\n<p class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>The major benefits of the&nbsp;EB-3 Visa</strong></span></p>\r\n<cite>1. Foreign workers can obtain green cards, live permanently, and work in the USA with their families.<br><br>2. Spouse and unmarried children under 21 years of age are permissible to accompany the worker to the USA.</cite></blockquote>\r\n<p><em>For more details please&nbsp;<a href=\"../contact/\">contact our senior immigration consultants and advisors.</a></em></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725342949_1719814211_USA-Image-03.webp', 'USA EB-3 Program', 'uploads/1725428684_USA-EB-3-2.webp', 'USA EB-3 - Immigration Visa for Skilled Workers', 'USA', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 06:10:11', '2024-09-04 07:07:55');
INSERT INTO `program` (`id`, `title`, `url_link`, `metadata`, `program_detail`, `Image`, `image_alt`, `deatil_image`, `detail_image_alt`, `country`, `program_form`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(18, 'USA EB-2 National Interest Waiver (NIW)\r\n', '/service/united-states/usa-eb-2/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Discover the perks of the USA EB-2 National Interest Waiver (NIW) for STEM professionals. Get expert help for an easy application.\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/united-states/usa-eb-2/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"USA EB-2 National Interest Waiver (NIW) - Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Discover the perks of the USA EB-2 National Interest Waiver (NIW) for STEM professionals. Get expert help for an easy application.\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/united-states/usa-eb-2/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-04-20T04:18:40+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725342969_1719814249_USA-Image-04.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1342\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"896\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"2 minutes\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<h2 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>USA EB-2 National Interest Waiver :</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p>The USA&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.uscis.gov/working-in-the-united-states/permanent-workers/employment-based-immigration-second-preference-eb-2\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://www.uscis.gov/working-in-the-united-states/permanent-workers/employment-based-immigration-second-preference-eb-2\">EB-2</a>&nbsp;National Interest Waiver (NIW) is a unique immigration option offered by the United States Citizenship and Immigration Services (USCIS) for foreign nationals who possess exceptional abilities and are interested in pursuing permanent residency in the U.S. The National Interest Waiver is specifically designed to attract foreign nationals who are in the field of science, technology, engineering, and mathematics (STEM) to help bolster the country&rsquo;s economy by contributing their exceptional skills and knowledge.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-container-3 wp-block-columns alignwide are-vertically-aligned-center\">\r\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\">\r\n<p>To understand the EB-2 National Interest Waiver, it is essential to know what an EB-2 visa is. The EB-2 visa is a type of employment-based visa that is available to individuals who possess advanced degrees or possess exceptional abilities in their respective fields. The National Interest Waiver is a type of exemption that allows applicants to bypass the requirement of a job offer from a U.S. employer or a labor certification process, which typically takes several months or even years.<br><br><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\"><br><br></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>To qualify for the USA EB-2 National Interest Waiver, applicants must meet specific criteria. Firstly, they must have an exceptional ability in their field, which includes significant contributions to their respective industries, authorship of scholarly articles or publications, original scientific, artistic, or business-related contributions, or recognition of achievements from reputable organizations in their field. Secondly, the applicant must seek legal permanent residency and provide evidence that their proposed work in the U.S. will be of substantial benefit to the country&rsquo;s economy, culture, or educational needs.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The National Interest Waiver offers several advantages for applicants. The most significant benefit is that it exempts them from the labor certification process, which can take months or even years. It also allows the applicant to self-petition for permanent residency, meaning they do not need a U.S. employer to sponsor them. Additionally, the applicant can expedite their case by filing a Form I-140 with the USCIS without having to go through an extensive review process.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The EB-2 National Interest Waiver is a challenging immigration option, and applicants are encouraged to seek legal representation when applying. An experienced immigration attorney can help applicants identify the most appealing aspects of their candidacy and package their application in a way that highlights their unique attributes and significant contributions to their field.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><em>For more details please&nbsp;<a href=\"../contact/\">contact our senior immigration consultants and advisors.</a></em></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725342969_1719814249_USA-Image-04.webp', 'USA EB-2 National Interest Waiver (NIW) Program', 'uploads/1725428636_EB2-2.webp', 'USA EB-2 National Interest Waiver (NIW)', 'USA', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 06:10:49', '2024-09-04 07:08:27');
INSERT INTO `program` (`id`, `title`, `url_link`, `metadata`, `program_detail`, `Image`, `image_alt`, `deatil_image`, `detail_image_alt`, `country`, `program_form`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(19, 'USA Temporary Residence Visas\r\n', '/service/united-states/usa-temporary-residence-visas/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Gain temporary residence in the USA with the USA Temporary Residence Visas. Explore eligibility criteria, benefits, and application process.\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/united-states/usa-temporary-residence-visas/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"USA Temporary Residence Visas - Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Gain temporary residence in the USA with the USA Temporary Residence Visas. Explore eligibility criteria, benefits, and application process.\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/united-states/usa-temporary-residence-visas/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-04-20T04:29:20+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725342989_1719814285_USA-Image-05.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1343\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"896\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"4 minutes\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<h2 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">USA Temporary Residence Visas:</span></h2>\r\n<p>A USA&nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Temporary_resident\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Temporary_resident\">Temporary Residence Visas,</a>&nbsp;also commonly known as a non-immigrant visa, is a type of visa essential for those who wish to stay in the United States for a specific period of time. This visa is granted to individuals who are not American citizens, but who wish to temporarily reside in the country for various reasons.<br><br>There are several types of temporary residence visas available in the United States. Some of the most common types are:<br><br>Tourist Visa &ndash; This type of visa is granted to individuals who wish to travel to the United States for tourism purposes.<br><br>Work Visa &ndash; This type of visa is granted to individuals who wish to work in the United States for a specific period of time.<br><br>Student Visa &ndash; This type of visa is granted to individuals who wish to study in the United States.<br><br>To obtain a USA Temporary Residence Visas, one must apply through the United States Embassy or Consulate located in their home country. The application process involves filling out a detailed form, providing necessary documentation, submitting fingerprints, and undergoing an interview.<br><br>The visa application process can be lengthy, and individuals must be able to prove that they have the necessary ties to their home country to ensure that they will return after their stay in the United States is complete. This is to prevent individuals from using the visa as a means to immigrate to the country permanently.<br><br>It is essential to note that USA Temporary Residence Visas have a limited validity, and individuals must leave the United States before the visa expires. Failure to do so can result in severe consequences, including being barred from entering the country again in the future.<br><br><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">VISITOR VISA &ndash; B1 / B-2</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>A visitor visa is issued to people who wish to enter a foreign country for a brief period of stay. To enter United States of America with an intention to carry out business-related activities, B-1 visa is authorized. The nature of business activities could include meeting with business associates, attending conferences or negotiating a contract. To enter the United States for the purpose of recreation, reuniting with family, participating in musical or sports contests with no monetary compensation, or to seek a medical opinion or treatment, B-2 visa is authorized.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><strong>Eligibility criteria and requirements:</strong><br>The purpose of the stay is for a limited time period, and is related to business or pleasure only<br>Have sufficient funds to cover the expenses of their intended stay<br>Proof of strong ties to their home country, to ensure their exit from US after the visa expires<br>While on a visitor visa, the applicant is not allowed to accept any employment opportunity in the United States<br>It is mandatory to declare if the applicant was ever arrested, cautioned or convicted. In case the applicant is found guilty of the crime committed, they may be ineligible to enter the United States, and will require to file for an ineligibility waiver.</p>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<h3 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">STUDENT VISA &ndash; F1</span></h3>\r\n<p>A student visa is issued to people who want to study in the United States. The nature of the visa could differ according to the type of institute and the course of study that you want to opt for. F-1 visa is authorized to international students who wishes to attend any educational institute, ranging from elementary to graduate school. Language training programs are also covered under this category of visa.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><strong>Eligibility and requirements:</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Secure an admission offer from an institute listed under the Student Exchange Visitor Program (SEVP). An acceptance from a school not listed under SEVP will not grant you F-1 visa</li>\r\n<li>Have sufficient funds to sponsor your intended stay of the study period. You are encouraged to apply for any scholarships that you may qualify for</li>\r\n<li>Proof of language proficiency through either TOEFL or IELTS</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><em>For more details please&nbsp;<a href=\"../contact/\">contact our senior immigration consultants and advisors.</a></em></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725342989_1719814285_USA-Image-05.webp', 'USA Visit Visa Program', 'uploads/1725429842_usa6.webp', 'USA Temporary Residence Visas', 'USA', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 06:11:25', '2024-09-04 07:13:39');
INSERT INTO `program` (`id`, `title`, `url_link`, `metadata`, `program_detail`, `Image`, `image_alt`, `deatil_image`, `detail_image_alt`, `country`, `program_form`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(20, 'Sponsorship Visa of USA\r\n', '/service/united-states/sponsorship-visa-of-usa/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Explore the Sponsorship Visa of USA to bring family members to the country. Get expert assistance for a smooth process.\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/united-states/sponsorship-visa-of-usa/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Sponsorship Visa of USA - Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Explore the Sponsorship Visa of USA to bring family members to the country. Get expert assistance for a smooth process.\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/united-states/sponsorship-visa-of-usa/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-04-20T04:37:01+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725343006_1719814338_USA-Image-06.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1343\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"896\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"7 minutes\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<h2 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Exploring the Land of Opportunities:</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Sponsorship Visa for the USA</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p>&ldquo;The United States of America is one of the most popular immigration destinations in the world, offering countless opportunities for immigrants to start a new life, pursue their dreams, and enjoy a better standard of living through the Sponsorship Visa of USA.&rdquo;</p>\r\n<p><br>A&nbsp;<a href=\"https://visaguide.world/visa-letters/us-visa-sponsorship/\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://visaguide.world/visa-letters/us-visa-sponsorship/\">sponsorship</a>&nbsp;visa is a type of visa that allows a U.S. citizen or permanent resident to sponsor a foreign national for immigration to the United States. This type of visa is also known as a family-based visa, as it is typically used by family members of U.S. citizens and permanent residents to join them in the country.<br><br>To apply for a sponsorship Visa of USA, your sponsor must file a petition with U.S. Citizenship and Immigration Services (USCIS). The petition should include evidence of the qualifying relationship between you and your sponsor, as well as any supporting documentation required by USCIS.<br><br>Once the petition is approved, you will be assigned a priority date based on the date the petition was filed. This priority date will determine when you are eligible to apply for a Visa.<br><br>If you are outside the United States at the time your visa becomes available, you will be required to attend an interview at a U.S. embassy or consulate in your home country.<br><br>If you are already in the United States when your visa becomes available, you may be able to adjust your status to permanent resident without leaving the country.<br><br></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\"><br><br></p>\r\n<h4 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Establishing a Qualifying Relationship for Sponsorship Visa in the USA</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p>You must have a qualifying relationship with a U.S. citizen or permanent resident sponsor. Qualifying relationships include:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Spouse</li>\r\n<li>Parent</li>\r\n<li>Child (including stepchild and adopted child)</li>\r\n<li>Sibling (including half-sibling and stepsibling)</li>\r\n<li>Fianc&eacute;(e)</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>In addition to having a qualifying relationship, you must also meet certain other eligibility requirements, such as passing a medical exam and obtaining a police certificate.<br><br></p>\r\n<h4 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Fulfilling Sponsorship Responsibilities</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p>when you are sponsorship Visa of USA citizen or permanent resident, your sponsor assumes certain responsibilities. These responsibilities include:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Financially supporting you for a specified period of time</li>\r\n<li>Agreeing to repay any public funds you may receive during that time</li>\r\n<li>Helping you adjust to life in the United States</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The sponsor&rsquo;s financial responsibilities begin as soon as you arrive in the country, and typically last for a period of ten years.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h4 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>SPOUSAL SPONSORSHIP &ndash; IR-1</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p>To encourage families to reunite, the United States allows the citizens and legal permanent residents to invite their foreign family members to come to the U.S. IR-1 is the immediate relative category, to invite the spouse. Eligibility is given below:</p>\r\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<cite>Must be legally married to a U.S. citizen or permanent resident<br>The one residing in the U.S. should have a valid address and documentation to prove his residency status.<br>He/she should also have enough financial resources to support the foreign spouse</cite></blockquote>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<h4 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>FIANCE` (E) VISA &ndash; K-1</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p>This category of non-immigrant visa is for anyone residing in a country other than United States, who wishes to get married to a citizen of United States. You will be required to marry the citizen within 90 days of your arrival in the US. Failure to comply by this rule goes against the laws and could result in your removal from the United States.</p>\r\n<h4 class=\"has-text-color\"><br><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Eligibility and requirements:</strong></span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Both should be above the legal age of 18 to get married.</li>\r\n<li>Both should not be married to someone else at the time, and if you are, then there should be evidence that the marriage is dissolved.</li>\r\n<li>The marriage must be permissible under the law of the United States.</li>\r\n<li>Within the past two years, the US citizen and his/her fianc&eacute; must have met in person at least once. Evidence of this must be provided in terms of photographs, travel records of any other documents. This requirement will only be waived off under extreme cases, such as not being permissible under the culture to meet before marriage.</li>\r\n<li>The US citizen must have enough financial resources to sponsor his/her fianc&eacute;.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<h4 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>UNMARRIED CHILD UNDER 21 YEARS OF AGE OF A U.S. CITIZEN &ndash; USA IR-2</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p>The IR-2 visa is a U.S. immediate relative visa, for children of U.S citizens, who are unmarried and are under 21 years of age. If the child is under the child status protection act, being treated as under 21 years old, then he/she can also be granted the visa.</p>\r\n<p>The children with IR-2 visa can live in U.S. and attend school. They will eventually also qualify to apply for green card and will be able to work in the U.S. without an Employment Authorization Document. The IR-2 visa does not have an annual cap. As long as applicants qualify the eligibility criteria, he/she can obtain it.</p>\r\n<p>Children with IR-2 visas who are under 18 years, gets U.S. citizenship as soon as they enter U.S. and live with their parents in the U.S. Children over the age of 18 become permanent residents and get their IR-2 green cards. They can apply for citizenship when they are eligible.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Eligibility (for the child):</strong><br>The child should be under 21 years old and unmarried<br>The child should be living in a foreign country<br>The child and the parent who is a U.S. citizen must have lived together for a minimum of 2 years<br>The parent should be a U.S. citizen<br>Other parent gives consent to adopt the foreign child</p>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<h4 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>ORPHAN ADOPTED ABROAD BY A U.S. CITIZEN &ndash; USA IR-3</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p>U.S. citizens who want to adopt children from foreign countries and bring them to the U.S. can do so if the child has a valid U.S. visa and is allowed to enter the U.S. IR-3 can be applied for once the adoption procedure is completed in the child&rsquo;s home country. Under this classification, the child can live in the U.S. with the adopted parents, enroll in a school or college, and eventually be a U.S. citizen when eligible.</p>\r\n<p>The procedure for the application may differ according to the country that the child is being adopted from. However, there are a few countries from where adoption is not permissible due to political reasons.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Eligibility and Requirements:</strong><br>The child must be under 21 years old and must be from a country which qualifies for adoption under the U.S. laws<br>The child must fulfil the adoption requirement of the U.S. Immigration and Nationality Act<br>The parent in the U.S. must have a valid residence/address and must clear the eligibility test for adoption by the U.S. Citizenship and Immigration Services<br>The U.S. citizen must plan to relocate the adopted child to the U.S.</p>\r\n<p>Note: If the parent (U.S. citizen) has already adopted the child and lived with him for two years, the child does not need to apply for IR-3 and would rather qualify for IR-2 visa</p>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<h4 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>ORPHAN TO BE ADOPTED IN THE U.S. BY A U.S. CITIZEN &ndash; USA IR-4</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p>This classification of visa allows the citizens to complete the adoption process after bringing the child to U.S. This allows the child to live legally in the U.S., study or work without needing an Employment Authorization Document.</p>\r\n<p><br><strong>Eligibility and Requirement:</strong><br>The child must be under 21 years old and must be from a country which qualifies for adoption under the U.S. laws.<br>The child must fulfil the adoption requirement of the U.S. Immigration and Nationality Act.<br>The parent in the U.S. must have a valid residence/address and must clear the eligibility test for adoption by the U.S. Citizenship and Immigration Services<br>The U.S. citizen must plan to relocate the adopted child to the U.S<br>The parent in the U.S. must take legal guardianship of the child in the foreign country, and also adopt in the U.S</p>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<h4 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>FAMILY PREFERENCE VISA</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p>Family visa comprises of four categories, depending on the relationship with the U.S. citizen:</p>\r\n<p><strong>F-1 Visa&nbsp;</strong>&ndash; The U.S. citizen&rsquo;s unmarried children, and their minor children are eligible for this type of visa<br><strong>F-2 Visa</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; Spouse, minor or children under the age of 21 years are eligible for this type of visa<br><strong>F-3 Visa</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; The U.S. citizen&rsquo;s married children, and their spouses and minor children are eligible for this type of visa<br><strong>F-4 Visa</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; If the U.S. citizen is at least 21 years old, his/her siblings and their spouses and minor children are eligible for this type of visa</p>\r\n<p><br><strong>Note</strong>: Family preference visa is not issued for grandparents, aunts, uncles or in-laws.</p>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<h4 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>PARENT OF A U.S. CITIZEN WHO IS AT LEAST 21 YEARS- USA IR-5</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p>After becoming a citizen of the United States, you can bring your immediate family members to the country. IR-5 visa allows the U.S. citizens to bring their parents from their home country into the U.S. Apart from reuniting with their children, the parents also enjoy the liberty to legally work without an Employment Authorization Document (EAD), once they are issued with an IR-5.</p>\r\n<p>This classification of visa does not have a yearly cap and therefore anyone who meets the eligibility criteria can obtain the U.S. visa.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Eligibility and Requirements:</strong><br>The U.S. citizen must be 21 years or older<br>The U.S. citizen must have enough financial resources to support his/her parents, at least until the time his/her parents start working.<br>The U.S. citizen must have a valid address and living there<br>Proof of relationship through a valid birth certificate</p>\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<p><em>For more details please&nbsp;<a href=\"../contact/\">contact our senior immigration consultants and advisors.</a></em></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725343006_1719814338_USA-Image-06.webp', 'Sponsorship Visa Services of USA ', 'uploads/1725429810_usa2.webp', 'Sponsorship Visa of USA', 'USA', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 06:12:18', '2024-09-05 10:10:29');
INSERT INTO `program` (`id`, `title`, `url_link`, `metadata`, `program_detail`, `Image`, `image_alt`, `deatil_image`, `detail_image_alt`, `country`, `program_form`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(21, ' Grenada Citizenship by Investment\r\n', '/service/caribbean-immigration-services/grenada-citizenship-by-investment-program/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Grenada Citizenship By Investment Program. Visa free travel to over 140+ countries, including UK, EU/Schengen, and China etc\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/caribbean-immigration-services/grenada-citizenship-by-investment-program/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Grenada Citizenship by Investment - Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Grenada Citizenship By Investment Program. Visa free travel to over 140+ countries, including UK, EU/Schengen, and China etc\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/caribbean-immigration-services/grenada-citizenship-by-investment-program/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-04-20T05:29:32+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725343023_1719814425_Caribbean-Image-02.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1342\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"896\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"3 minutes\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<h2 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Grenada Citizenship by Investment: Your Gateway to Global Opportunities</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grenada\">Grenada</a>, a small Caribbean island, offers one of the most sought-after citizenship-by-investment programs globally, providing an efficient and safe pathway to a second passport. For many wealthy individuals, Grenada citizenship by investment program offers a rare opportunity to acquire a powerful travel document that opens doors to travels, business, and life opportunities worldwide.<br><br>The Grenada Citizenship by Investment Program was established by the government in 2013, formally known as the Grenada Citizenship by Investment Act of 2013. The program empowers non-citizens to invest in Grenadian economy, opening a fast-track route to citizenship for qualifying individuals. The highly-respected program requires applicants to meet strict eligibility criteria, making it a highly regulated and transparent process.<br><br>Grenada citizenship offers several advantages to investors, including visa-free travel to over 140 countries and the ability to work, study, or start a business in the United States through Grenada&rsquo;s E-2 Treaty program. The E-2 visa provides an excellent opportunity for individuals seeking access to the US economy without the hassle of a lengthy visa application process.<br><br>Grenada citizens can enjoy visa-free travel to numerous countries, including the UK, Schengen States, and China, making it a compelling option for travelers, businesspeople, and digital nomads. Unlike other citizenship-by-investment programs, Grenada has no residency requirements, making it easier and more convenient for investors with limited time to spare.<br><br>Another added advantage of the Grenada citizenship program is that it allows applicants to add dependent children, siblings, or parents over the age of 55 to their application, with additional fees required. The process of acquiring Grenada citizenship is straightforward and hassle-free. It involves submitting the application to a licensed agent, followed by due diligence checks, background checks, and vetting by Grenadian government officials.<br><br>.<img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">Investment requirement:</strong></span></p>\r\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><cite>To be eligible for Grenada&rsquo;s Citizenship, applicants must either make an investment of at least US $350,000, to be maintained for a minimum of 5 years OR make a Donation starting from US $235,000 for a family of Three.</cite></blockquote>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Citizenship:</strong>&nbsp;Direct citizenship &amp; passport within 3 to 6 months</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<h3 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Benefits:</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>No physical residency required to gain citizenship.</li>\r\n<li>Visa free travel to over 140+ countries, including UK, EU/Schengen, and China etc</li>\r\n<li>Citizenship can be passed down by descent, so future generations can also benefit from it.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<h3 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Eligible Family Members:</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Spouse</li>\r\n<li>Children under 18</li>\r\n<li>Children aged 18-30 (if they are current full-time students and unmarried)</li>\r\n<li>Unmarried siblings dependent on Principal Applicant</li>\r\n<li>Financially dependent Parents/grandparents of Principal Applicant or spouse, age above 55</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><em>For more details please&nbsp;<a href=\"../contact/\">contact our senior immigration consultants and advisors.</a></em></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725343023_1719814425_Caribbean-Image-02.webp', ' Grenada Citizenship by Investment Program', 'uploads/1725429765_Grenada-Citizenship-by-Investment.webp', ' Grenada Citizenship by Investment', 'Caribbean', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 06:13:45', '2024-09-27 06:25:46');
INSERT INTO `program` (`id`, `title`, `url_link`, `metadata`, `program_detail`, `Image`, `image_alt`, `deatil_image`, `detail_image_alt`, `country`, `program_form`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(22, 'Dominica Citizenship by Investment\r\n', '/service/caribbean-immigration-services/dominica-citizenship-by-investment/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Dominica Citizenship by Investment Program Visa-free/visa-on-arrival travel to over 120 countries, including UK, Schengen Zone\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/caribbean-immigration-services/dominica-citizenship-by-investment/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Dominica Citizenship by Investment - Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Dominica Citizenship by Investment Program Visa-free/visa-on-arrival travel to over 120 countries, including UK, Schengen Zone\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/caribbean-immigration-services/dominica-citizenship-by-investment/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-04-20T05:40:04+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725343040_1719814458_Caribbean-Image-03.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1343\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"896\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"2 minutes\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<h2 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Dominica Citizenship by Investment</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dominica\">Dominica</a>, also known as the &ldquo;<strong>Nature Isle of the Caribbean</strong>&rdquo; because of its incredible natural landscapes, introduced its citizenship by investment program in 1993. It is considered as the world&rsquo;s longest running economic schemes. It is ranked as number one citizenship programs by the CBI index.<br><br>The Dominica Citizenship by Investment Program offers a fast and efficient route to obtaining a second passport. The application process is straightforward, and approvals are usually granted within 90 days. The investment options are flexible and offer affordable entry levels.<br><br>Obtaining dual citizenship has become increasingly popular in recent years, and for good reason. Having a second passport not only allows for greater global mobility but also offers a range of economic benefits. The Dominica Citizenship by Investment Program offers one such pathway to citizenship for those looking to seize these opportunities.<br><br></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\"><br><br></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"color: #bf8f59;\">Investment requirement:</strong></span></p>\r\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><cite>The applicant must either opt for ONE of the following:<br><br><strong>1. Real Estate Option:</strong> Investment of at least US $200,000. The property is to be held for a minimum of three years and may be eligible for re-sale after five years.<br><br><strong>2. Donation Option:</strong> Donation starting from US $200,000, depending on the family composition</cite></blockquote>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Citizenship:</strong>&nbsp;Direct citizenship &amp; Passport within 3 to 6 months.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<h3 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Benefits:</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>No physical residency required to gain citizenship</li>\r\n<li>Visa-free/visa-on-arrival travel to over 120 countries, including UK, Schengen Zone, and Switzerland etc</li>\r\n<li>Citizenship can be passed down by descent, so future generations can also benefit from it</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<h3 class=\"has-text-color\"><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Eligible Family Members:</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Spouse</li>\r\n<li>Children up to 18 years of age</li>\r\n<li>Children and aged 18-30 (if they are current full-time students &amp; unmarried)</li>\r\n<li>Financially dependent Parents/grandparents of Principal Applicant or spouse, age above 55</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><em>For more details please&nbsp;<a href=\"../contact/\">contact our senior immigration consultants and advisors.</a></em></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725343040_1719814458_Caribbean-Image-03.webp', 'Dominica Citizenship by Investment Program', 'uploads/1725429739_Dominica-Citizenship-by-Investment.webp', 'Dominica Citizenship by Investment', 'Caribbean', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 06:14:18', '2024-09-27 06:19:35');
INSERT INTO `program` (`id`, `title`, `url_link`, `metadata`, `program_detail`, `Image`, `image_alt`, `deatil_image`, `detail_image_alt`, `country`, `program_form`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(23, 'Saint Lucia Citizenship By Investment Program\r\n', '/service/caribbean-immigration-services/saint-lucia-citizenship-by-investment-program/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Explore Saint Lucia\'s Citizenship By Investment Program with our visa consultants. Get citizenship and a passport in just 4-6 months, with visa-free travel to 145+ countries and tax benefits.\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/caribbean-immigration-services/saint-lucia-citizenship-by-investment-program/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Saint Lucia Citizenship By Investment Program - Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Explore Saint Lucia\'s Citizenship By Investment Program with our visa consultants. Get citizenship and a passport in just 4-6 months, with visa-free travel to 145+ countries and tax benefits.\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/caribbean-immigration-services/saint-lucia-citizenship-by-investment-program/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-04-20T04:53:53+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725343061_1719814501_Caribbean-Image-04.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1342\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"897\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"2 minutes\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<p>The Caribbean island of&nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saint_Lucia\">Saint Lucia</a>is renowned for its pristine beaches, lush rainforests, and vibrant cultural celebrations. However, it is also attracting attention from investors, entrepreneurs, and high net worth individuals due to its Citizenship by Investment (CIP) program. This program allows individuals and families to obtain citizenship in Saint Lucia by investing in the country&rsquo;s economy. In this article, we will explore the Saint Lucia Citizenship by Investment program and its benefits.<br><br>The Saint Lucia Citizenship by Investment Program is a legal process that grants citizenship and related benefits to foreign investors who invest in the country&rsquo;s economy in the form of a donation, real estate investment, or a business venture. The program was established by the Saint Lucia government in 2015 to attract foreign investment and promote economic growth in the country. The program is designed to be relatively fast and straightforward, with a processing time of about 3 to 4 months.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><strong>Citizenship:</strong>&nbsp;Direct citizenship &amp; Passport within 4 to 6 months.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Benefits:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visa-free travel: Becoming a citizen of Saint Lucia allows individuals and their families to travel visa-free or visa-on-arrival to over 145 countries, including the Schengen Area, the UK, and Hong Kong.</li>\r\n<li>Tax benefits: Saint Lucia has no wealth, inheritance, or capital gains tax. Also, citizens are not subject to worldwide income taxation unless they reside in Saint Lucia for more than 183 days.</li>\r\n<li>Dual citizenship: Saint Lucia recognizes dual citizenship, which means that you can hold a second passport without renouncing your original citizenship.</li>\r\n<li>Family inclusiveness: Your spouse, dependent children, parents, and grandparents can also become citizens of Saint Lucia under the program&rsquo;s family unity regulations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Investment Options:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>National Economic Fund (NEF): The government of Saint Lucia established the NEF to finance economic projects that will benefit the country. Investors can donate at least $240,000 for a family of Four, to the NEF to qualify for citizenship.</li>\r\n<li>Real Estate Investment: Investors can purchase pre-approved real estate properties in Saint Lucia for at least $200,000 and own the property for at least five years before selling it.</li>\r\n<li>Business Investment: Investors can also invest at least $3.5 million in an approved commercial venture in Saint Lucia to qualify for citizenship.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Eligible Family Members:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Spouse</li>\r\n<li>Children under 25 (if they are current full-time students)</li>\r\n<li>Parents, above 65, if they are financially dependent on the applicant</li>\r\n<li>Inclusion of mentally or physically challenged dependent children and/or parents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725343061_1719814501_Caribbean-Image-04.webp', 'Saint Lucia Citizenship By Investment Program', 'uploads/1725429704_St.-Lucia.webp', 'Saint Lucia Citizenship By Investment', 'Caribbean', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 06:15:01', '2024-09-12 04:00:42'),
(24, 'Antigua & Barbuda Citizenship Program', '/service/caribbean-immigration-services/antigua-barbuda-citizenship-program/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Discover Antigua & Barbuda\'s Citizenship Program with our immigration consultants. Enjoy visa-free travel to 130+ countries and tax benefits.\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/caribbean-immigration-services/antigua-barbuda-citizenship-program/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Antigua & Barbuda Citizenship Program - Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Discover Antigua & Barbuda\'s Citizenship Program with our immigration consultants. Enjoy visa-free travel to 130+ countries and tax benefits.\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/caribbean-immigration-services/antigua-barbuda-citizenship-program/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-04-20T05:32:12+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725343077_1719814542_Caribbean-Image-05.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1343\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"897\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"3 minutes\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<p>Antigua &amp; Barbuda, situated in the Eastern Caribbean, is a paradise of tropical islands, crystal clear waters, and sandy beaches. This nation has always been renowned for its beauty, culture, and diverse economy, drawing in tourists and investors from all over the world. In 2013, Antigua &amp; Barbuda introduced its Citizenship-by-Investment Program (CIP) to attract foreign investment in the nation&rsquo;s economy.<br><br>The program is designed to offer a second passport to individuals and their families who invest in the country&rsquo;s economy. The citizenship by investment requires an applicant to make an investment in the country either through a real estate purchase or a donation to the National Development Fund (NDF). The applicant must go through a due diligence process, which includes a background check, to ensure that they do not have a criminal record.<br><br>Once an applicant makes a successful application, and their investment is approved, they are granted citizenship, which allows them to have access to travel visa-free to over 165 countries, including the European Union, The United Kingdom, Singapore, and Hong Kong, among other countries. Citizenship acquired through CIP in Antigua allows an individual to reside in major financial and business centers.<br><br>Antigua and Barbuda has a tax-friendly regime that doesn&rsquo;t tax income or wealth earned outside of the country, making it a tax haven. The path to citizenship is also uncomplicated and fast, taking about two to four months to complete, allowing the investor to obtain dual citizenship quickly.<br><br>The CIP program has contributed to the country&rsquo;s economic growth, promoting employment and offering greater opportunities to the citizens. The fund generated from the NDF is used for the country&rsquo;s infrastructure and other development needs, which has resulted in a thriving economy.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Investment requirement:&nbsp;</strong></span><br>Investor may qualify for citizenship by choosing one of the following:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Real estate option:</strong>&nbsp;Investment of US $ 400,000 in pre-approved real estate development area, which has to be maintained for 5 years. Under Limited Time Offer, related parties can make a joint investment of US $400,000 with each applicant investing US $ 200,000 in order to qualify for citizenship.</p>\r\n<p><strong>2. Donation option:</strong> Donation of US $230,000 for a family of four to the National Development Fund (NDF) established by the Government.</p>\r\n<p><strong>3. Physical Residency:</strong>&nbsp;Total 5 days in 5 years after obtaining citizenship.</p>\r\n<p><strong>4. Citizenship:</strong>&nbsp;Direct citizenship &amp; Passport within 3-6 months.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Benefits:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Visa free travel to 130+ Countries including UK, EU/Schengen Zone, Singapore, UAE etc.</li>\r\n<li>Citizenship can be passed down by descent, so future generations can also benefit from this investment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Eligible Family Members:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Spouse</li>\r\n<li>Children under 18 and aged 18-28 (if they are current fill-time students and have been turning 18)</li>\r\n<li>Financially dependent Parents/grandparents of Principal Applicant or spouse, age above 58</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725343077_1719814542_Caribbean-Image-05.webp', 'Antigua & Barbuda Citizenship by Investment Program', 'uploads/1725429656_Antigua.webp', 'Antigua & Barbuda Citizenship by Investment', 'Caribbean', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 06:15:42', '2024-09-11 11:12:31'),
(25, 'Montenegro Citizenship By Investment', '/service/europe/montenegro-citizenship-by-investment/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Explore Montenegro Citizenship By Investment with Pakistani immigration consultants. An easy pathway to citizenship with our expert guidance\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/europe/montenegro-citizenship-by-investment/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Montenegro Citizenship By Investment - Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Explore Montenegro Citizenship By Investment with Pakistani immigration consultants. An easy pathway to citizenship with our expert guidance\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/europe/montenegro-citizenship-by-investment/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-04-20T05:58:31+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725343093_1719814626_Europe-Image-02.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1342\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"896\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"2 minutes\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center; color: #bf8f59;\">This Program is in Suspension at the moment.<br>Below details are for the purpose of information only.</h2>\r\n<br>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Montenegro\">Montenegro</a>, a small country situated in the Balkan Peninsula in Southeast Europe, is now offering foreign investors citizenship through investment. This program is known as the Montenegro Citizenship By Investment (CBI) program. The program was introduced in 2019 to revive their economy and create job opportunities for the people of Montenegro.<br><br>The Montenegro CBI program is one of the newest residency programs in the world that offers EU citizenship. It is gaining popularity among foreign investors who want to obtain a European passport. Montenegro has made it easier for investors to invest in their country and become citizens through their citizenship by investment program. The investor gets the Montenegrin passport within six months of investment, making it the fastest citizenship program amongst other EU countries.<br><br>The Montenegro CBI program has a competitive edge over similar programs offered by neighboring countries such as Greece, Cyprus, and Malta. It is much cheaper to obtain Montenegro citizenship through investment and offers more affordable real estate prices compared to other EU countries.</p>\r\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Investment requirement:&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<cite>Donation of &euro; 100,000 to the Government of Montenegro, along with an investment in either a government approved Real Estate worth &euro; 250,000 in Northern Part of Montenegro OR an investment worth &euro; 450,000 in Southern Part of Montenegro/Capital City of Podgorica.</cite></blockquote>\r\n<p><strong>Investment Holding Period:</strong>&nbsp;5 Years</p>\r\n<p><strong>Citizenship:</strong>&nbsp;Direct citizenship with passport obtained within 6 to 8 Months.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Benefits:</strong></span><br>1. Visa Free Travel to 120 countries including Schengen Area, Russia, Bulgaria, and Turkey etc<br>2. No physical residency required<br>3. Montenegro is a candidate country for EU membership and expected to join by the year 2025<br>4. The program provides a lifetime citizenship for family and generations</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Eligible Family Members:</strong></span><br>1. Spouse<br>2. Dependent children up to 18 years of age<br>3. Dependent children above 18 years of age if financially dependent on the main applicant</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725343093_1719814626_Europe-Image-02.webp', 'Montenegro Citizenship By Investment Program', 'uploads/1725429614_Montenegro.webp', 'Montenegro Citizenship By Investment', 'Europe', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 06:17:06', '2024-09-12 07:11:40'),
(26, 'Malta – Permanent Residency Program\r\n', '/service/europe/malta-permanent-residency-program/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Discover Malta Permanent Residency Program with trusted visa consultants in Pakistan. Gain expert assistance for smooth application.\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/europe/malta-permanent-residency-program/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Malta - Permanent Residency Program - Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Discover Malta Permanent Residency Program with trusted visa consultants in Pakistan. Gain expert assistance for smooth application.\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/europe/malta-permanent-residency-program/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-04-20T06:06:55+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725343105_1719814673_Malta-01.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1342\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"896\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"2 minutes\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<p>Malta comprises a compact cluster of islands situated in the central Mediterranean Sea, located to the south of Italy&rsquo;s Sicily. Its strategic location serves as both a cultural and political bridge connecting Europe and North Africa.<br><br>The region enjoys a superb climate, a populace known for its warmth and hospitality, and maintains a secure and stable environment with minimal criminal activity. Additionally, Malta holds full membership within the European Union and is part of the Schengen area.<br><br>The Malta Permanent Residency Program offers an opportunity for eligible family members to join the application, permitting the inclusion of up to four generations. This program allows the applicant and their family members to enjoy unrestricted residency within Malta indefinitely.<br><br>MPRP represents a lifetime residency initiative, necessitating PR card renewal every five years. The renewal process is extended to encompass children who have recently turned 14 and 18 years old.<br><br>Under this program, the investor and their family are required to travel to Malta twice: once upon approval of the application and subsequently every five years for biometric verification as part of the card renewal process. Notably, there exists no mandatory minimum stay requirement for participation in the MPRP.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Process Time:</strong>&nbsp;12 months</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Benefits:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Permanent residency for life.</li>\r\n<li>Visa free travel within Schengen area.</li>\r\n<li>Good Healthcare and Education system.</li>\r\n<li>No Minimum stay required.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Eligible Family Members:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Principal applicant must me above the age of 18 years.</li>\r\n<li>No Criminal Record.</li>\r\n<li>No Visa denial.</li>\r\n<li>Have assets amounting to at least 500,000 euros out of which 150,000 euros must be financial assets.</li>\r\n<li>Unmarried and financially dependent children can be part of the application.</li>\r\n<li>Financially dependent Parents and Grandparents can be part of the application.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Investment Options:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Rental Property:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pay a non-refundable contribution fee of (&euro;) 98,000 to the government after the application is approved.</li>\r\n<li>Make a philanthropic donation of (&euro;)2000.</li>\r\n<li>Rent a residential unit for five years in Malta for (&euro;) 10,000 in the South of Malta and Gozo per year. The remaining (&euro;)40,000 are to be paid in the next 4 years.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Purchase a Property:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pay a non-refundable contribution fee of (&euro;) 68,000 to the government after the application is approved.</li>\r\n<li>Make a philanthropic donation of (&euro;) 2000.</li>\r\n<li>Purchase a residential unit for five years in the South of Malta / Gozo for a minimum (&euro;) 300,000 or in Central Malta for (&euro;) 350,000.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725343105_1719814673_Malta-01.webp', 'Malta Permanent Residency Program', 'uploads/1725429584_1720084078_Malta.webp', 'Malta Permanent Residency ', 'Europe', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 06:17:53', '2024-09-04 07:10:09'),
(27, 'Bulgaria Immigration Program\r\n', '/service/europe/bulgaria-immigration-program/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Explore the Bulgaria Immigration Program with expert assistance from Lalani Associates, your trusted immigration consultant.\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/europe/bulgaria-immigration-program/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Bulgaria Immigration Program - Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Explore the Bulgaria Immigration Program with expert assistance from Lalani Associates, your trusted immigration consultant.\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/europe/bulgaria-immigration-program/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-04-20T05:55:26+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725343122_1719814714_Europe-Image-03.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1342\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"896\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"3 minutes\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center; color: #bf8f59;\">This Program is in Suspension at the moment.<br>Below details are for the purpose of information only.</h2>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The Bulgaria Immigration Program is a popular path for non-EU nationals who desire either residency or citizenship in the country. The program offers investors and entrepreneurs the opportunity to achieve Bulgarian residency or citizenship by investing in property, buying government bonds or stocks, or establishing a business in the country.<br><br>Obtaining Bulgarian residency through the Bulgaria Immigration Program is straightforward and entails investing in government bonds or stocks, purchasing a property worth &euro;300,000, or generating a yearly income of &euro;60,000. The program allows investors to travel freely within the Schengen area, and resident permit holders can also work in Bulgaria and have access to education and healthcare benefits.<br><br>Foreigners can achieve Bulgarian citizenship after five years of continuous residency in the country. This includes permanent residency holders who have resided in Bulgaria for at least five years and those who obtained residency through the Bulgaria Investment program. Upon acquiring Bulgarian citizenship, investors obtain citizenship from the EU.<br><br>The Bulgaria Immigration Program presents several advantages for investors and entrepreneurs. One is the convenience of accessing the EU market. Bulgaria&rsquo;s strategic location creates opportunities for entrepreneurs to reach key markets like the Middle East, Russia, and Europe. The country has a favorable business environment, and entrepreneurs can easily register a company and set up a business without dealing with excess bureaucracy.<br><br>The Bulgaria Immigration Program also offers an attractive tax regime for investors. The country levies a 10% flat tax, which is one of the lowest in the EU. Investors in Bulgaria&rsquo;s Immigrant Investor Program enjoy special tax exemptions, including a 10-year tax holiday on profits from corporate and personal income taxes.<br><br>Bulgaria has a low cost of living compared to other EU countries, making it an appealing destination for investors who want to save money while enjoying a high standard of living. Property prices are affordable, and Bulgarian citizenship and residency holders have access to free healthcare and education.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bulgaria\">Bulgaria</a>&nbsp;offers several immigration programs that allow foreigners to obtain residency or citizenship in the country. Here are some of the most popular ones:</p>\r\n<p><strong>Financing Option:&nbsp;</strong>One-time walk away payment of &euro; 260,000 towards the purchase of Bulgaria Government Bonds or Listed Stocks for a minimum value of &euro; 1,024,000 for a period of at least 5 years.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Real Estate Option:&nbsp;</strong>Purchase of two furnished units in a new condominium complex worth &euro; 430,000 to be eligible for Bulgarian.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Citizenship:</strong>&nbsp;Eligible after 5 years of Permanent Residency or after 1 year of Permanent Residency under Fast Track option.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Benefits:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>EU passport. Right to live, work, study and reside in any EU country.</li>\r\n<li>Access to EU health cards and discounted fee in state school for children in EU countries</li>\r\n<li>No physical residency required</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Eligible Family Members:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Spouse</li>\r\n<li>Children under 18 years of age</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725343122_1719814714_Europe-Image-03.webp', 'Bulgaria Immigration Program', 'uploads/1725429548_fhxpcb.webp', 'Bulgaria Citizenship by Investment ', 'Europe', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 06:18:34', '2024-09-12 07:15:25');
