(28, 'Cyprus Citizenship By Investment Program\r\n', '/service/europe/cyprus-citizenship-by-investment-program/', '<meta name=\'robots\' content=\'index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1\' />\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Explore Cyprus Citizenship By Investment Program with the help of Pakistan\'s leading visa and immigration experts.\" />\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/europe/cyprus-citizenship-by-investment-program/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Cyprus Citizenship By Investment Program - Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Explore Cyprus Citizenship By Investment Program with the help of Pakistan\'s leading visa and immigration experts.\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/service/europe/cyprus-citizenship-by-investment-program/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Lalani Associates\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/LalaniAssociates/\" />\r\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-04-20T06:02:04+00:00\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lalaniassociates.com/Admin/uploads/1725343139_1719814748_Europe-Image-04.webp\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1342\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"897\" />\r\n<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lalaniassoc\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\r\n<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"2 minutes\" />', '<div class=\"demo-text-section section pt-95 pt-lg-75 pt-md-65 pt-sm-55 pt-xs-45 pb-95 pb-lg-75 pb-md-65 pb-sm-55 pb-xs-45\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"demo-text\">\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center; color: #bf8f59;\">This Program is in Suspension at the moment.<br>Below details are for the purpose of information only.</h2>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The&nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cyprus\">Cyprus</a> Citizenship by Investment Program is a popular option for foreign investors seeking to obtain European Union citizenship.<br><br><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Process:</strong>&nbsp;</span><br>The application process typically takes around six months and includes a thorough background check by the Cypriot government to ensure the applicant does not have a criminal record.<br><br>Once approved, the applicant and their family members (spouse and children under the age of 28) are granted Cypriot citizenship, which allows them to live, work, and study in any EU country.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\"></p>\r\n<p><br><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Benefits:</strong>&nbsp;</span><br>Cypriot citizenship offers several benefits, including access to the EU&rsquo;s education, healthcare, and business opportunities.<br><br>Cyprus has a favorable tax regime, including no tax on worldwide income for non-domiciled individuals and favorable corporate tax rates.<br><br>Cyprus has a high standard of living, with a strong economy and a pleasant Mediterranean climate.<br><br>It is important to note that the Cyprus Citizenship by Investment Program has been subject to criticism and controversy, particularly regarding potential risks of money laundering and security concerns. As with any investment program, it is important to conduct thorough research and consult with a qualified professional before making a decision.</p>\r\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Investment requirement:</strong></span></p>\r\n<cite>Donate &euro; 150,000, hold a main residence worth &euro; 500,000 in residential for lifetime and invest at least &euro; 1,500,000 in the purchase or construction of buildings</cite></blockquote>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Physical Residency:</strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Visit Cyprus once in every 7 years</p>\r\n<p><strong>Citizenship:</strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Direct Cyprus citizenship within 3 to 6 months.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #bf8f59;\"><strong>Eligible Family Members:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Spouse</li>\r\n<li>Children under 28 (if they are currently full-time students and unmarried)</li>\r\n<li>Dependent parents (can be included with additional investment)</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'uploads/1725343139_1719814748_Europe-Image-04.webp', 'Cyprus Citizenship By Investment Program', 'uploads/1725429484_Cyprus.webp', 'Cyprus Citizenship By Investment', 'Europe', 'sample_form', '2024-07-01 06:19:08', '2024-09-12 07:13:42');
